<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">1 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim tlâng ram Ramathaim-zophim khuaah chuan mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Elkana a ni; chu mi chu Jehorama fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Elihua fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Tohua fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Ephraim mi Zupha fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, nupui pahnih a nei a: a pakhata hming chu Hani a ni a, a pakhata hming chu Penini a ni a; tin, Penini chuan fate a nei a, Hani erawh chuan fate a nei ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chu an khua aṭangin Silo khuaah Sipaihote Lalpa be tûr leh inthawi tûrin kum tin a han kal ṭhîn a. Chutah chuan Elia fapate pahnih, Hophnia leh Phinehasa, Lalpa puithiamte an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Elkana inthawi ni a lo thlen chuan, a nupui Penini leh a fapate leh a fanute zawng zawng chu chanvo a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hani chu hmangaih êm êm mah se, Lalpan fa nei thei lova a siam avângin chan khat chauh a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fa a neih theih loh avânga a lungngaihna tizual tûrin amah ertu Penini chuan a lo deusawh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chutianga kum tin a tih avângin Lalpa ina a han kal apiang chuan a lungngaihna chu a lo chawh thawhsak ṭhîn a; chutichuan, a ṭap a ṭap a, chaw pawh a ei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a pasal Elkana chuan a hnênah, “Hani, engati nge i ṭah? Engati nge chaw i ei loh? Engati nge i thin a nat? Fapa sâwm ai pawhin i tân ka ṭha zâwk lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Silo khuaa chaw an eia an in zawh chuan Hani chu a tho va. Tin, puithiam Elia chu Lalpa biak in kawngka ban bula a ṭhutnaah chuan a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Hani chu a rilru a mangang êm êm mai a, Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, lungchhe takin a ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, thu a tiam a, “Aw Sipaihote Lalpa , i bâwihnu tlâwmzia hi min hriatsak takmeuhva, min hriat renga, i bâwihnu hi min theihnghilh lohva, i bâwihnu hi fapa i pêk chuan, a dam chhûng zawng Lalpa ka pe ve thung ang a, a lû pawh meh rêng rêng a ni lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lalpa hmaa a ṭawngṭai reng lai chuan Elia chuan a hmui phun chu a lo chhinchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hani chuan a rilruin a sawi a, a hmui chauh a phu a, a aw chu hriat a ni lo va. Chuvângin, Elia chuan zu a rui niin a ring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Elia chuan a hnênah, “Eng chen nge rui renga i awm dâwn le? I uain chu dah bo rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Hani chuan, “Ka rui lo asin ka pu, hmeichhe rilru lungngai tâwpkhâwk ka ni a; uain pawh, zupui pawh ka in hauh lo va, Lalpa hmaah ka rilru ka phawrh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I bâwihnu hi Beliala fanuah puh lul suh ang che; ka rilrua khat liam ka lungnih lohna leh ka lungngaihna ka sawi a nih hi,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Elia chuan, “Thlamuang takin kal rawh khai, Israel-te Pathian chuan i thil dîl chu pe che rawh se,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “I chhiahhlawhnu hian i mit lo tlung rawh se,” a ti a. Chutichuan, hmeichhia chu a kal ta a, chaw te a ei a, lungngai hmêl a pu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, zîng takah an tho va, Lalpa chu an bia a, an haw a, Rama khuaa an in chu an thleng leh ta a. Tin, Elkana chuan a nupui Hani chu a pâwl a; tin, Lalpa chuan ani chu a hre reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, heti hi a ni a, Hani chuan nau a pai a; tin, a hun a lo thlen chuan fapa a hring a; “ Lalpa ka dîl a ni,” tiin a hmingah Samuela a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Elkana leh a chhûngte zawng zawng chu Lalpa hnêna an kum tin inthawina hlân tûr leh a thutiam hlen tûrin an kal chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hani erawh chu a kal chho ve lo va; a pasal hnênah chuan, “Kei zawng naupangin hnute hnêk a bân hma loh chuan ka kal chho ve lo vang e; chumi hnuah chuan Lalpa hmaa a inlan theih nân ka hruai ang a, chutah chuan a awm reng tawh dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a pasal Elkana chuan a hnênah, “Ṭha âwm i tih apiang chuan ti rawh, a hnute hnêk i bântîr thlengin awm rawh; amaherawhchu, Lalpa chuan a thu chu tinghet ngei rawh se,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a hnute hnêk bân hma loh chuan hmeichhia chu a awm ta a, a fapa chu hnutê a hnêktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hnute hnêk a bântîr chuan, chhangphut epha khat leh uain saidawiûm khat kengin sebâwng pathum nên a han hruai a, Silo khuaa Lalpa inah chuan a kalpui a. Naupang chu a la naupang hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, bâwngpa chu an talh a, naupang chu Elia hnênah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Aw ka pu, i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, kei chu e ka pu, hemi hmuna i kianga dinga Lalpa hnêna ṭawngṭai hmeichhia kha ka ni ngei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He naupang dîl hian ka ṭawngṭai a ni a; tin, Lalpa chuan ka dîl chu min pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, kei pawhin Lalpa hnênah ka hlân a ni; a dam chhûng zawnga Lalpa tâna hlan a ni,” a ti a. Tin, chutah chuan Lalpa chu an bia a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Hani chu a ṭawngṭai a: “ Lalpa chungah ka thinlung a lâwm êm êm a, Ka ki chu Lalpa -ah chawimawiin a awm; Ka hmêlmate chungah ka kâ tihzauvin a awm a, I chhandamnaah chuan ka lâwm êm êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa anga thianghlim hi an awm lo; Nangmah ang rêng an awm si lo, Kan Pathian ang lungpui rêng a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuti taka chapovin thu sawi tawh suh ula; In kâ aṭangin ṭawng chaltlai rêng rêng chhuak suh se; Lalpa chu finna Pathian a ni si a, Amahin thiltihte a bûk fel ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi chak thal ngulte a titliak a, Petekte tai chu chaknaa hrênin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlaipuar ṭhînte chu ei tûr zawngin an inhlawhfa ta a, Rilṭâm ṭhînte chu an châwl ta. A ni, ching chuan pasarih a hring ta; Fa tam tak nei nu chu a chau ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a tihlum ṭhîn a, a tinung bawk ṭhîn. Thlânah a chhuktîr ṭhîn a, a hruai chhuak bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a tirethei ṭhîn a, a tihausa bawk ṭhîn; A titlâwm ṭhîn a, a chawisâng bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaivut ata rethei chu a kai tho ṭhîn a, Pachhia chu êkdûr ata a chawikâng ṭhîn; Mi liante hnêna a awmtîr theiha, Ropuina lalṭhutthlêng an chan theih nân. Leilung nghahchhan chu Lalpa ta a ni a, Khawvêl chu a chungah a nghat ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mi thianghlimte ke chu a vêng ang a, Mi sualte erawh chu thim zîngah tihngawih ṭhiapin an awm ang; Chakna chuan tu mân an ngam dâwn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa beitute chu an keh sawm ang; Vân aṭanga khawpui riin a do vang. Lalpa chuan kâwlkil thlengin ro a rêl ang a; A lal chu chakna a pe ang a, A hriak thiha ki chu a chawimawi ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Elkana chu Rama khuaah a inah chuan a haw ta a. Tin, naupang chuan puithiam Elia hmaan Lalpa rawng chu a bâwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Elia fapate chu Beliala fapate an ni a; Lalpa chu an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, mipuite laka puithiamte tih dân chu, miin inthawina an rawn hlan hian, sa chhum lai takin puithiam chhiahhlawh hi sa thurna thîrkut zum thum nei mi kengin a lo kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, bêl rawng zau emaw, bêl dâwt nei emaw, bêl khaina nei emaw, bêl emaw chhûng chu a zuk chhun a; tin, chumi sa thurna zumin a rawn thur chhuah zawng zawng chu puithiamin a la ṭhîn a ni. Chutiang chuan Israel mi, chuta lo kal zawng zawngte lak ata chu Silo khuaah chuan an lo tihsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ni, a thau chu a hâl hmain puithiam chhiahhlawh chu a lo kal a, inthawia hnênah chuan, “Puithiam tâna hem hmin tûr sa mi pe rawh; i sa chhum chu a duh lo va, a hel a duh a ni,” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mi chuan a hnênah, “A thau chu hâl phawt mai sela; tin, chumi zawhah chuan i nunnain a duh zât zât i la dâwn nia,” an lo tih te hian, ani chuan, “Ni lo ve, mi pe nghâl tûr a ni; min pêk loh chuan ka la lui rêng rêng ang,” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, tlangvâlte sualna chu Lalpa mit hmuhin a lo nasa ta êm êm mai a; mite chuan Lalpa hnêna inthawina hlan te chu an ngaihnêp phah ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Samuela chu naupang mah ni sela, puan zai sîn puithiam kawr hain Lalpa hmaah rawng a bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chu lo pawh chu a nuin kawrfualte a ṭhuisak a, an kum tin inthawina hlân tûra a pasal nêna an kalin kum tin a kensak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Elia chuan Elkana leh a nupui chu mal a sâwm a, “ Lalpa tâna in thilhlan in hlan hi he hmeichhe thlah hian Lalpan rûl che u rawh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, an in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Hani chu a kan a, nau a pai a, fapa pathum leh fanu pahnih a hring a. Tin, naupang Samuela chu Lalpa hmaah chuan a lo sei lian ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Elia chu a lo tar ta hle mai a; Israel mite zawng zawng chunga a fate thiltih zawng zawng leh, inbiakna puan in kawngka bula rawngbâwltu hmeichhiate an lo mutpui ṭhin thûte a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, an hnênah, “Engati nge hetiang thil in tih ni le? Hêng mi zawng zawng aṭangte hian in thiltih dân ṭha lote ka lo hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khai! Khai! Ka fate u, in chanchin ka lo hriat chu a ṭha lo lam hlîr a ni. Lalpa mite chu in bawhchhiattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi pakhat mi dang chunga a sual chuan Pathianin ro a rêlsak ang a. Amaherawhchu, mi, Lalpa chunga a sual chuan tuin nge ngenpui ang?” a ti a. Chuti chung pawhin an pa thu chu an âwih duh chuang lo va; chuvângin, Lalpa chuan anmahni chu tihhlum a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, naupang Samuela chu a ṭhang lian deuh deuh va; Pathian leh mihring duh zâwngin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Elia hnênah chuan Pathian mi pakhat a lo kal a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aigupta rama Pharaoa bâwiha an awm lai khân in thlahtute hnênah khân ka inlâr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Israel hnam zawng zawng zîng ata ka maichâma kala, rimtui hâla, ka hmaa puithiam kawr ha tûrin ka puithiam atân amah chu ka ruat a ni lâwm ni? Tin, i thlahtute chu Israel mite hâlral thilhlan zawng zawng ka pe a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Eng vângin nge ka awmnaa hlan tûra ka ruat ka hnêna inthawina leh ka puala thilhlan chu in rah beha, keimah aia i fate i chawimawi zâwka, nangmahni intihthau nâna ka mi Israel-te inthawina a ṭha ṭha in hman ni?’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan, ‘Kei chuan i chhûngte leh i pa chhûngte chu kumkhuain ka hmaah in awm ang chu ka ti ngei mai a,’ a ti a; nimahsela, tûnah hian Lalpa chuan, ‘In awm tawp lo vang; mi chawimawi apiangte chu ka chawimawi ang a, mi hmusit apiangte chu ka ngaihnêp an ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai teh, i bân te, i pa chhûngte bânte ka tan ni chu a lo thleng dâwn ta, i inah tar kûna dam rêng rêng an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel mite Pathianin neihnunna a la pêk hunah te chuan ka awmna ina tuarna i la hmu ang a; tin, i inah chuan tar kûna dam rêng rêng an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, i mi, ka maichâm ata ka tihbo loh tûra chu i mit tikham tûr leh i rilru tilungngaitu tûr a ni ang a; i ina lo piang apiangte chu an vânglai takin an thi zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, i fapate pahnih Hophnia leh Phinehasa chunga thil lo thleng tûr chu i tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang: ni khatah an pahnihin an thi ve ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, puithiam rinawm tak ka tân ka din ṭha leh ang a, chu chuan ka thinlung leh ka rilru rem zâwngin a ti ang a; tin, chhûngkaw nghet takah ka din ang a, kumkhuain ka hriak thiha hmaah chuan a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, i ina la awm zawng zawngte chu tangkarua leh chhang dîlin an kal ang a, chibai an bûk ang a, “Chhang tlêm tal ei tûr ka hmuh theih nân puithiam hna eng emaw min thawhtîr rawh khai,” an ti ang,’ a ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, naupang Samuela chuan Elia hmaah chuan Lalpa rawng a bâwl a. Chûng lai chuan Lalpa thu chu a thleng khât hle mai a; a langa inlârnate a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng lai chuan Elia chu ama hmuna a mut laiin (a mit a thim tawh deuh va, khua a hmu ṭha thei tawh mang lo va),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian khâwnvâr pawh a la mih hmain, Pathian bâwm awmna Lalpa biak inah chuan Samuela chu a han mu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Samuela a ko va. Ani chuan, “Heta hi ka awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Elia hnênah chuan a va tlân a, a hnênah, “Heta hi ka awm e, min ko va,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan “Ka ko lo va che; va mu leh tawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a kal a, a va mu leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Samuela chu a ko leh a. Tin, Samuela chu a tho va, Elia hnênah chuan a kal a, “Heta hi ka awm e, min ko va,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Ka ko lo va che, ka fapa, va mu leh tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Samuela chuan Lalpa chu a hre lo va, Lalpa thu a hnêna puan a la ni bawk lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Samuela chu a ko leh a, chu chu a vawi thumna a ni. Tin, a tho va, Elia hnênah chuan a kal a, “Heta hi ka awm e, min ko va,” a ti a. Tichuan, Elia chuan naupang chu Lalpan a ko a ni tih a lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Elia chuan Samuela hnênah, “Kal la, va mu leh ta la, a koh leh che chuan, ‘ Lalpa , thu sawi rawh, i chhiahhlawhin a ngaithla e,’ i ti a ni ang chu,” a ti a. Tichuan, Samuela chu a hmunah chuan a va mu leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu a lo kal a, a ding a, a hmaa a koh ang khân, “Samuel, Samuel,” tiin a ko leh a. Chutichuan, Samuela chuan, “Thû sawi rawh, i chhiahhlawhin a ngaithla e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “Ngai teh, Israel ramah hian a hria apiangte beng a khing hnih hniha ṭhâwng zâwng takin thil ka ti dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan a chhûngkaw chungchâng thu ka sawi zawng zawng chu, a bul aṭangin a tâwp thlengin Elia chungah ka ti dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A faten Pathian an sawi chhiatna sual chu hre reng pawha a khap loh avângin, a chhûngkua chu kumkhua atân ka ngaihtuah dâwn a ni tih ka hrilh tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Elia chhûngkaw hnênah chuan Elia chhûngte bawhchhiatna chu inthawinain emaw, thilhlanin emaw, eng tikah mah tihkian theih a ni lo vang tiin chhia ka chham tawh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chu zîng thlengin a mu a; tin, Lalpa in kawngkhârte chu a hawng a. Chutichuan, Samuela chuan chumi inlârna chu Elia hriattîr a hlauthâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Elia chuan Samuela chu a ko va, “Samuel, ka fapa,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Heta hi ka awm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Eng thil nge Lalpa chuan i hnênah a sawi le? Ka lakah eng mah zêp suh aw. I hnêna a sawi zawng zawng chu ka laka zêp i neih chuan i chungah Pathianin a tih tihin ti sela, chu aia nasa pawhin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan engkim a hrilh fai ta vek a, a lakah chuan eng mah zêp a nei lo va. Tichuan, ani chuan, “ Lalpa a ni alâwm, ṭha a tih ang zêlin ti rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chu a lo ṭhang lian deuh deuh va, a hnênah Lalpa a awm zêl a, a thu rêng rêng chu leilungah a luan raltîr lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thleng raka Israel mite zawng zawng chuan, Samuela chu Lalpa zâwlnei atân tihngheh a ni tih an lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu Silo-ah chuan a inlâr leh a. Lalpa chu thuin Samuela hnênah chuan Silo-ah a inlâr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Samuela thu chu Israel mite zawng zawng zîngah a thang chhuak ta a. Tin, Israel mite chu Philistia mite do tûrin an kal chhuak a, Ebenezer kiangah ṭanhmun an khuar a; tin, Philistia mite chuan Aphek-ah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chu Israel mite dang tûrin an lo inzâr pharh a. Tin, an han inbeih chuan Philistia mite hmaah chuan Israel mite chu an tlâwm ta a, indona hmunah chuan sipai sângli emaw lai an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu an riahhmuna an va kal chuan Israel upate chuan, “Eng vângin nge vawiinah hian Philistia mite hmaah Lalpa chuan min tihtlâwm ni aw? Kan hnêna awma, kan hmêlmate kut ata min chhandam tûrin Silo ata Lalpa thuthlung bâwm chu i han la ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chuan Silo-ah chuan mi an tîr a, chuta ta chu cherub-ho chunga ṭhu, Sipaihote Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm chu an va la ta a. Tin, Pathian thuthlunna bâwm an lâknaah chuan Elia fapate pahnih, Hopnia leh Phinehasa an tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thuthlunna bâwmin an riahhmun a lo thlen chuan, Israel mi zawng zawngte chu ring takin an au dur dur mai a, lei te lam pawh a nghawr ri dur dur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Philistia miten an au thâwm an hriat chuan, “Hebrai-ho riahhmuna au thâwm ri ta dur dur mai chu eng tizia nge ni le?” an ti a. Tin, an riahhmunah Lalpa bâwm a lo thleng a ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chuan an hlau ta a, “Riahhmunah pathian a lo kal ta a nih chu,” an ti a. “Kan chung a pik e! Tûn hma lamah chutiang a awm ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan chung a pik e! Chûng pathiante kut chak tak ata chu tuin nge min chhandam ang? Chûng pathiante chu an ni, Aigupta mite thlalêra hri chi tinrênga tihlumtu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, nangni Philistia mite u, in chhiahhlawha an awm ang khân Hebrai-hote chhiahhlawha in awm loh nân chak takin awm ula, intimipa rawh u; intimipa ula, bei zêl rawh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Philistia mite chuan an bei a, Israel mite chu an tlâwm a, an puan in lam ṭheuhvah an tlân ta vek mai a. An that nasa êm êm mai a, Israel-ho zînga sipai sîngthum an thi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian bâwm pawh chu an lâksak a; tin, Elia fapate pahnih, Hophnia leh Phinehasa-te chu an that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sipai zînga Benjamina thlah mi pakhat a tlân a, a puante ṭet phung leh a lûa lei kai luamin chumi ni la la chuan Silo a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a va thlen chuan ngai teh, Elia chuan kawng sîra a ṭhutnaah ṭhu chungin a lo thlîr reng a, Pathian bâwm avâng khân a rilruin a khûr a khûr a. Tin, mi chuan khua a han thlena, chanchin chu a han sawi chuan a khuain an au ta chuah chuah mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Elian an au thâwm a lo hriatin, “Chu ri mur mur chu eng tizia nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, mi chu hmanhmawh takin a va kal a, Elia chu a va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elia chu kum 98 mi a ni a, a mit a thim tawh a, khua a hmu thei tawh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mi chuan Elia hnênah chuan, “Sipai zîng aṭanga lo kal ka nih hi, vawiinah hian sipai zîng ata lo tlân ka ni,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ka fapa, eng angin nge thil a awm le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chanchin rawn thlentu chuan a chhâng a, “Israel mite chu Philistia mite hmaah chuan an tlânchhia a; tin, mipui zîngah inthahna nasa tak a awm bawk a; tin, i fapate pahnih, Hophnia leh Phinehasa pawh an thi a; tin, Pathian bâwm pawh an lâksak ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chutia Pathian bâwm thu a han sawi veleh chuan Elia chu kawngkhâr bula ṭhutphah ata a zangthalin a tlu a; a nghâwng a tliak a, a thi ta a, amah a tar tawhin a inzo tawh lo a ni. Tichuan, Israel-te chungah kum sawmli ro a rêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a monu, Phinehasa nupui chuan nau a pai a, a hrin a hnai tawh hle a; Pathian bâwm an lâksak tih thu a han hriata, a pu leh a pasal an thi tih a han hriat chuan a kaikûn a, nau a hring ta a, a nâ chuan a rawn nang ta nghâl si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a thih dâwn ṭêpa a kianga ding hmeichhiate chuan a hnênah, “Hlau suh, fapa i hrin tâk hi,” an ti a. Nimahsela, a chhâng hauh lo va, a ngaihsak hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, “Ropuina chuan Israel chu a chhuahsan ta!” tiin naupang hmingah chuan Ikaboda a sa a, Pathian bâwm chu an lâksak ta a, a pu leh a pasal pawh an thi ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ropuina chuan Israel-te chu a chhuahsan ta, Pathian bâwm chu an lâksak ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia mite chuan Pathian bâwm chu an la a, Ebenezer ata chu Asdod khuaah an kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chuan Pathian bâwm chu an la a, Dagona biak inah an la lût a, Dagona kiangah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Asdod khuaa mite chu a tûk zing taka an han thawh chuan, ngai teh, Lalpa bâwm hmaah chuan Dagona chu a hmaia lei siin a lo tlu dêr mai a. Tichuan, Dagona chu an la a, a awmna hmunah chuan an dah leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a tûk leh zîng taka an han thawh chuan, ngai teh, Lalpa bâwm hmaah chuan Dagona chu a hmaia lei siin a lo tlu dêr mai a. Dagona lû leh a kutphah bâwr khing hnih chhum chu kawngka bulah chuan a lo lum reng mai a; Dagona taksa chauh chu a lo awm ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan Dagona puithiam te, Dagona biak ina lo kal ṭhîn rêng rêngte pawhin Asdod khuaa Dagona kawngka bul chu tûn thlengin an rap ngam lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa kut chuan Asdod khuaa mite chu a delh ta hle mai a, chhiatna a thlensak ta hlawm a; Asdod khua leh a chheh vêlte chu ngâwtin a hrem ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Asdod khuaa miten chutiang chu a nih an lo hriatin, “Israel-te Pathian bâwm chu kan hnênah awm reng teh suh se, kan chung leh kan pathian Dagona chunga a kutthlâk a na êm mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia lal zawng zawngte chu an hnênah an ko khâwm a, “Israel-te Pathian bâwm chu engtin nge kan tih ang?” an ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Israel-te Pathian bâwm chu Gath khuaah va kalpui rawh u,” tiin an chhâng a; tichuan, Israel-te Pathian bâwm chu an va kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, chutia an kalpui lai chuan Lalpa kut chuan khua chu a tibuai ta nuaih nuaih mai a; khuaa mihringte chu a lian a têin a hrem a, ngâwtna hri an chungah a lêntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian bâwm chu Ekron-ah an thawn lêt a, a va thlen chuan Ekron khuaa mite chu, “Israel-te Pathian bâwm chu keimahni leh kan mite tihlum tûrin kan hnênah an rawn la ta,” tiin an au ta chiam mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia lal zawng zawngte chu an ko khâwm a, “Israel-te Pathian bâwm hi kal botîr ula, keimahni leh kan mite min tihhlum loh nân a awm hmun pângngaiah kal leh rawh se,” an ti a. Khaw pum puiah chuan thihna khawp buai nuaih nuaihna a awm a; Pathian kut chuan chu khua chu a delh hle mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a thi lote chu an ngâwt hlawm a; tichuan, chu khaw au thâwm chuan vân khi a han thleng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm chu Philistia mite ramah chuan thla sarih a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chuan, “ Lalpa bâwm chu engtin nge kan tih ang? A awmna pângngaia kaltîr lehna zia min hrilh teh u khai,” tiin puithiamte leh aienthiamte an ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Israel-te Pathian bâwm hi in kaltîr dâwn pawhin a ruak chuan kaltîr hauh suh u, a hnênah bawhchhiat thawina hlân ngei ngei rawh u. Tichuan, tihdamin in awm ang a; tin, engtiziaa a kut chu in hnên ata sawn lo nge ni tih in hria ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, anni chuan, “A hnêna kan bawhchhiat thawina hlan tûr chu eng nge ni ang?” an ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Philistia lal zâtin rangkachak ngâwt lem panga leh rangkachak chaichîm lem panga; in zaa chunga hri lêng leh in lalte chunga lêng chu hmun khat a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, in ngâwt lemte leh in ram tichhetu chaichîm lemte siam ula, Israel-te Pathian chu chawimawi rawh u; tichuan, a kut chu in chungah te, in pathian leh in ram chungah te a tizâng duh mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta mite leh Pharaoan rilru an tihkhauh ang khân engati nge in rilru in tihkhauh ni? An zînga thilmak tak a tih khân mite chu an kaltîr a, an chhuak ta a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah hian tawlailîr thar buatsaih ula, bâwngpui pahnih, a hnute sâwr lai, nghâwngkawl la bel ngai hauh loh nên; chûng bâwngpuite chu tawlailîrah chuan bel ula; tin, a note chu in lamah rawn hruai hâwnsak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm chu la ula, tawlailîrah chuan dah ula; tin, bawhchhiat thawi nâna in hlan rangkachak thil hlu chu thingremah khungin a sîrah dah ula. Kaltîr ula, thlah mai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, amaha ramri lampang kawng zawhin Beth-semes-ah a kal emaw en teh u; a kal chuan kan chunga thil ṭha lo tak hi ama tih a lo ni ang a, a kal loh chuan min hremtu chu ama kut a lo ni lo tih kan hria ang a, kan chungah a lo awm ve hrim hrim mai a ni ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan chutiang chuan an ti a; bâwngpui, a hnute sâwr lai pahnih an hruai a, tawlailîrah chuan an bel a, a note chu in lamah an khung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm chu tawlailîrah chuan an dah a, rangkachak chaichîm lem leh ngâwt lem dahna thingrem nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, bâwngpuite chuan Beth-semes lam panin kawng chu an zawh ta ngat ngat a; tichuan, bû chung zêlin kawngpui chu an zawh a, ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw an pêng hlek lo va; tin, Philistia lalte chuan Beth-semes ramri thlengin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Beth-semes khuaa mite chuan ruamah hian an buh an lo seng a, an hawi chho va, bâwm chu an han hmu a, an lâwm ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, tawlailîr chu Beth-semes khuaa mi Josua lovah chuan a lo lût a, lungpui lian tak awmna laiah chuan a ding ta reng a; tin, tawlailîr thing chu an ek a, Lalpa biak nân bâwngpuite chu hâlral thilhlanah an hmang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Levi chite chuan Lalpa bâwm chu rangkachak thil hlu awmna thingrem nên chuan an la thla a, lungpui chungah chuan an dah a; tin, Beth-semes khuaa mite chuan chumi ni vêk chuan hâlral thilhlante leh inthawinate Lalpa hnênah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Philistia lal pangate chuan an en zawh hnuin, chumi ni la la chuan Ekron khaw lamah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistia miten rangkachak ngâwt lem Lalpa hnêna bawhchhiat thawi nâna an hlan chu heti zât hi a ni: Asdod khaw pualah pakhat, Gaza khaw pualah pakhat, Askelon khaw pualah pakhat, Gath khaw pualah pakhat, Ekron khaw pualah pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, rangkachak chaichîm lem chu khua zawng zawng, kulh nei khua leh thingtlâng lam khua pawh chhiar veka lal pangate ta, Philistia mite khaw zât a ni a; Lalpa bâwm an nghahna lungpui ngei chu Beth-semes khuaa mi Josua lovah chuan tûn thleng hian a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm chhûng an en avângin Beth-semes khuaa mite chu a hrem a. An zîngah mi sîngnga leh sawmsarih zet a hrem a ni; Lalpan a hrem nasat êm avâng chuan mite chu an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth-semes khuaa mite chuan, “He Pathian thianghlim, Lalpa hmaah hian tu nge ding thei ang a, kan hnên ata hi tu hnênah nge a kal chhoh tâk ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Kiriath-jearim khuaa mite hnênah chuan, “Philistia mite chuan Lalpa bâwm chu an rawn dah leh ta a, lo chhuk ula, in hnên lamah la chho rawh u khai,” tia hrilh tûrin mite an tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Kiriath-jearim khuaa mite chu an zu kal a, Lalpa bâwm chu an la chho va, tlânga Abinadaba inah chuan an la lût a, a fapa Eleazara chu Lalpa bâwm enkawltu atân an tihrang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Kiriath-jearim-a bâwm a awm chhûng chu rei tak a ni a, kum sawmhnih zet a ni. Tin, Israela chhûngte zawng zawngin Lalpa chu an lunglên leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Israela chhûngte zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “In thinlungtak zeta Lalpa lam lo hawi in nih tak tak chuan, ram dang pathiante leh Astorethi-te chu in zîng ata dah bo daih ta che u, in thinlung chu Lalpa tân buatsaih ula, ama rawng chauh bâwl rawh u; tichuan, Philistia mite kut ata hi a chhan chhuak dâwn che u nia,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan Baala-te leh Astorethi-te chu an dah bo ta a, Lalpa rawng chauh chu an bâwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan, “Israel mi zawng zawngte chu Mizpe-ah ko khâwm vek ula, Lalpa hnênah ka ṭawngṭaisak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Mizpe-ah an kal khâwm ta a; tin, tui an chawi a, Lalpa hmaah chuan an leih bua a. Chumi ni chuan chaw an nghei a, chutah chuan, “ Lalpa chungah chuan kan lo sual ta a ni,” an ti a. Tin, Samuela chuan Mizpe-ah chuan Israel mite ro a rêlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Philistia miten Mizpe-ah Israel mite an awm khâwm tih an hriat chuan Israel mite bei tûrin Philistia lalhote chu an thawk chho va. Chu chu Israel miten an lo hriat chuan Philistia mite chu an hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel mite chuan Samuela hnênah, “Philistia mite kut ata min chhandam tûra Lalpa kan Pathian min auhsak chu bâng suh khai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan berâmno hnute hne lai a la a, pumhâl hlan atân Lalpa hnênah a hlân a. Tichuan, Israel mite tân Samuela chuan Lalpa chu a au va; tin, Lalpa chuan a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuelan hâlral thilhlan a hlan lai tak chuan Philistia mite chuan Israel mite chu beih tumin an rawn hnaih a. Nimahsela, chumi ni chuan Lalpan Philistia mite chungah khawpui nasa tak maiin a rîktîr ta dur dur mai a, a tibuai ta nuaih nuaih a, Israel mite hmaah chuan an tlâwm ta dêr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chu Mizpe aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Philistia mite chu an ûm a, Beth-kar hnuai an thlen thlengin an that zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan lung a la a, Mizpe leh Sen inkârah chuan a phun a. “Hei leh chen hi Lalpan min pui a ni,” tiin, a hmingah chuan Ebenezer a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia mite chu an tlâwm ta a, Israel-te ramah chuan an kal leh ta lo va; tin, Lalpa kut chuan Philistia mite chu Samuela dam chhûng zawng chuan a tai ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Philistia miten Israel mite khua an lâkte chu Ekron aṭanga Gath thlengin Israel mite an pe kîr leh a, a ram chu Israel miten Philistia mite kut ata an chhan chhuak a. Tin, Israel mite leh Amor mite chu inremin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan a dam chhûngin Israel mite ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, kum tinin Bethel leh Gilgal leh Mizpe hi a kan vêl ṭhîn a; chûng hmunahte chuan Israel mite ro a rêl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a in awmna a nih avângin Rama khuaah chuan a haw ṭhîn a; chutah chuan Israel mite ro a rêl a, chutah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Samuela chu a lo upa ta a, a fapate chu Israel mite chunga rorêltuah a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A fa tîr hming chu Joela a ni a, a dawttu hming chu Abija a ni a; Beer-seba-a rorêltu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, a fate chuan a awm dân chu an la ve lo va, sum leh pai lam an ûm a, thamnate an la a, dik lo takin ro an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mite upaho zawng zawng an inkhâwm a, Rama khuaah Samuela hnênah an kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a hnênah, “Ngai teh, i lo upa ta hle mai a, i fapate lah chuan i awm dân an la ve si lo va; hnam dang zawng zawngte ang bawka kan chunga rorêl tûrin lal min siam rawh khai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, a hnênah, “Ro min rêlsaktu tûr lal min pe rawh,” an tih thu chuan Samuela chu a tilâwm lo hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Samuela chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a. Tin, Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “Mipuiten i hnêna an sawi zawng zawng chu ngaithla rawh; nang duh lo che an ni lo va, an chunga lal atân keimah mi duh lo an ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah ni aṭanga tûn thlenga an thiltih dân zawng zawng, min hawisana pathian dang rawng te min bâwlsan ṭhîn ang bawk hian i chungah an ti a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvangin, an thu chu ngaithla rawh. Amaherawhchu, urhsûn taka tiamkamin an chunga rorêltu lal chêt dân tûr chu kawhhmuh chiah rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Lalpa thu zawng zawng chu lal dîltu mipuite chu a hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“In chunga rorêltu tûr lal chêt dân tûr chu hetiang hi a ni ang: in fapate chu a sakawr leh a tawlailîr chuanpuiah a ruat ang a, tawlailîr hmaa tlânte an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sipai sâng hotuah te, sawmnga hotuah te a ruat ang a; tin, ṭhenkhat chu a lei lettu atân te, a buh sengtu atân te, a indo thuamhnaw siamtu atân te, a tawlailîr hmanraw siamtu atân te a hmang ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, in fanute chu rimtui siamtuah te, chaw chhûmtuah te, chhang siamtuah te a hmang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, in lo te, in grêp huan te, in olive huan te, a ṭha ṭha te a chhuhsak ang che u a, a chhiahhlawhte a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, in thlai chî leh in grêp huana mi sâwma pakhat a lâksak ang che u a, a chhiahhlawhte leh hotute a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, in chhiahhlawhpa te, in chhiahhlawhnu te, in tlangvâl ṭha ṭha te, in sabengtung te a chhuhsak ang che u a, a hnathawktu atân a ruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In berâm ruala mi sâwma pakhat a lâksak ang che u a; tin, a chhiahhlawhte in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chumi hunah chuan in la thlan tûr in lal avâng chuan in rûm chhuak ang a; nimahsela, chumi hun chuan Lalpan a chhâng lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, mipuite chuan Samuela thu chu an pawm duh lo va, “A ni lo ve, lal kan nei ngei tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tichuan, hnam dang zawng zawngte ang kan lo ni ang a; tin, kan lal chuan ro min rêlsak ang a, kan hnamte hruaiin râlte min dopui ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan mipuite thusawi zawng zawng chu a hria a, Lalpa hnênah a thlen lehchhâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “An thu chu pawm la, lal siamsak rawh,” a ti a. Tin, Samuela chuan Israel mite hnênah chuan, “Mi tin mahni khuaah haw ṭheuh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin rama Benjamina thlah mi pakhat, mi chak huaisen tak hi a awm a, a hming chu Kisa a ni a, chu mi chu Abiela fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Zerora fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Bekoratha fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Aphia fapa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan fapa a nei a, a hming chu Saula a ni, tlangvâl tlâwntlai ṭha tak a ni a, Israel mite zîngah chuan a aia tlâwntlai ṭha rêng rêng an awm lo va; tu mah a koki khûm pawh an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Saula pa Kisa sabengtungte a bo hlawm a. Tin, Kisa chuan a fapa Saula hnênah chuan, “Tho la, chhiahhlawh pakhat hruai la, sabengtung va zawng teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Ephraim tlâng ram te a fang a, Salisa ram te pawh a fang a; nimahsela, an hmu lo va. Tichuan, Saalim ram an fang leh a, chutah pawh chuan an awm lo va. Tin, Benjamin mite ram a fang leh a; nimahsela, an hmu ta chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuph ram an thlen chuan Saula chuan a hnêna awm ve, a chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “Hawh teh, i haw leh teh tawh mai ang; chuti lo chuan, ka pain sabengtung ngaihtuah ṭhulhin keimahni min ngaihtuah dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, he khuaah hian Pathian mi a awm a, mi zahawm tak a ni a, a sawi apiang chu a lo thleng ngei ngei ṭhîn a ni. Hawh teh, chutah chuan i kal teh ang; kan kalna tûr te hi min hrilh thei mial mahna,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “Nimahsela e, ngai teh, kal ta ang ila, chu mi chu eng nge kan kensak ang? Kan bâwmah chhang lah a awm tawh si lo va, Pathian mi lâwmman ken tûr a awm hauh lo mai. Eng nge kan neih aw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chhiahhlawh chuan Saula chu a chhâng leh a, “Ngai teh, tangkarua sekel hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat chu ka la keng a. Chu chu, kan kalna tûr min hrilh manah Pathian mi chu ka pe ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Tûn hma lam chuan Israel-hote zînga miin Pathian râwn an duh hian, “Hawh teh, hmutheitu hnênah i kal teh ang,” an ti ṭhîn a; tûnlaia zâwlnei an tih ṭhina hi tûn hma lam chuan hmutheitu an ti ṭhîn a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “A ṭhat hlauh chu; i kal teh ang hmiang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Pathian mi awmna khuaah chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khaw pan chhohnaa an han chhoh lai chuan nula tui chawi tûra lo chhuakte an han hmu a, an hnênah, “Hetah hian hmutheitu chu a awm em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an chhâng a, “Awm e, in hmaah a lo kal asin. Hmanhmawh rawh u khai; vawiinah hian hmun sângah mite an inthawi avângin he khuaah hian a lo kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua in han luh veleh hmun sânga chaw ei tûra a kal hmain in han hmu nghâl mai ang. Inthawina chu malsâwmtu tûr a nih avângin, a thlen hma loh chuan mipui chuan chaw an ei dâwn lo a ni; chumi hnuah chuan an mi sâwmte chuan an ei ṭhîn a ni. Chuvângin, kal chho thuai ula, in han hmu nghâl mai ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, khuaah chuan an kal chho ta a; tin, khua an han luh chuan ngai teh, Samuela hmun sânga kal tûr chuan a tâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Saula lo kal hma ni khatah chuan Lalpa chuan Samuela chu a bekbawr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Naktûk hetih hun lai hian Benjamin ram aṭangin i hnênah mi pakhat ka rawn kaltîr dâwn a, ka mi Israel-te chunga hotu ni tûrin hriak i thih ang a, ani chuan Philistia mite kut ata ka mite a chhandam ang; an au thâwm chuan ka hnên a lo thlen tâk avângin ka mite chu ka ngaihsak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Samuelan Saula a hmuh chuan Lalpan a hnênah, “En teh, i hnêna ka mi sawia kha; ani hian ka mite chungah thu a nei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan kulh kawngkaah Samuela chu a va hnaih a. “Hmutheitu in chu khawiah nge a awm min hrilh teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Saula chu a chhâng a. “Keimah hi hmutheitu chu ka ni; ka hmaah hian hmun sâng lam panin kal la, vawiinah hian ka hnênah chaw i ei dâwn a ni; tin, naktûk zîngah chuan ka kaltîr ang chia, i rilrua awm zawng zawng pawh ka hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, i sabengtung, ni thum bo tawhte thu chu lungkham suh, an hmu tawh e. Israel-te zînga ropuina zawng zawng chu tu tân nge ni? I tân leh i pa ina mi zawng zawng tân a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan a chhâng a, “Israel hnam zînga tê ber, Benjamin hnam ka ni lâwm ni? Tin, kan chhûngkua pawh Benjamin hnam chhûngkua zawng zawng zînga tê ber a ni lâwm ni? Engtiziaa hetianga ka hnêna sawi nge i nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Saula leh a chhiahhlawh chu a hruai a, mikhual pindanah chuan a hruai lût a, an mi sâwm, sawmthum lai zîngah chuan hmun ropui berah a ṭhuttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan chaw chhûmtu hnênah chuan, “I hnêna dah hran tûr ka tih, chanvo ka pêk che kha han la rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, chaw chhûmtu chuan a bawp leh a chunga awm chu a rawn la a, Saula hmaah chuan a va hlui a. Tin, Samuela chuan, “En teh, ka lo dah hrana chu! Kîl la, ei rawh; hemi hun atân hian hei hi kan lo ruatsak rêng che a ni, ‘Mite ka sâwm khâwm e,’ ka ti tawh bawk si a,” a ti a. Chutichuan, chumi ni chuan Saula chuan Samuela te nên chawhlui an kîl za ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hmun sâng ata khuaa an chhuk chuan, in chungah Saula chu mutna an siamsak a, a mu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, zîng takah, vârṭianah an tho va; Samuela chuan in chunga awm Saula chu a ko va, “Tho la, ka kaltîr teh tawh ang che,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Saula chu a tho va, an pahnih chuan an kal chhuak a, amah leh Samuela chu an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khaw hmâwr lam chu an zuk thlen chuan, Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “Chhiahhlawh hi ka hma lamah kaltîr la, (ani chu a kal ta a) nang erawh chu ding rih la, Pathian thu ka han hrilh teh rih ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan hriak bâwm chu a han phawrh a, a luah chuan a leih a, a fâwp a, “ Lalpa chuan a rochante chunga hotu ni tûrin hriak a thih che a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vawiina mi chhuahsan hnu hian, Zelza-ah Benjamin ramria Rakili thlân kiangah mi pahnih i hmu ang a; tin, anni chuan i hnênah, ‘Sabengtung i zawn chu an hmu tawh e. Tin, ngai teh, i pa chuan sabengtung chu a ngaihtuah tawh lo va, nangmah mawlh a ngaihtuah che a, “Ka fapa chu engtin nge ka tih tâk ang?” a ti a ti mai,’ an ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan kal zêl la, Tabor sasua chu i va thleng ang a. Chutah chuan mi pathum, Bethel-a Pathian hnêna han kal tûrten an lo tâwk ang chia, pakhat chuan kêlno pathum a pawm ang a, pakhat chuan chhangpêr tlang thum a keng ang a, pakhat leh chuan uain peng a keng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chibai an bûk ang chia, chhangpêr tlang hnih an pe ang chia, chu chu i la ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Philistia sipaiho awmna Pathian tlâng chu i va thleng ang a. Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, chuta khua i va thlen chuan zâwlneiho, perhkhuang te, khuangtê te, phênglâwng te, ṭingṭang kengte hruaia hmun sâng aṭanga lo chhuk i tâwk ang a; tin, thu an sawi dual dual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thlarau chu nasa takin i chungah a lo thleng ang a, nang pawh thu an sawi dual dualnaah chuan i tel ve ang a, mi danglam daihah i lo chang mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hêng chhinchhiahnate hi i chunga a lo awm hunah chuan thil lo awmin a zir ang zêlin i ti tûr a ni; Pathian i hnênah a awm zêl si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ka kal hmain Gilgal-ah lo zuk kal la; tin, ngai teh, kei pawh hâlral thilhlante leh remna inthawinate hlân tûrin i hnênah ka lo chhuk ang a. I hnêna ka lo kala, i tih tûr ka rawn hrilh hma che chuan ni sarih i lo awm tûr a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chutiang chu a lo ni ta ngei a, Samuela ṭhen tûra a hnuchhawn veleh chuan Pathianin thinlung danglam daih a pe ta a; tin, chûng chhinchhiahna zawng zawngte chu chumi ni chuan a lo thleng ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gibea tlâng chu an han thlen chuan, ngai teh, zâwlneihovin an tâwk a; tin, Lalpa thlarau nasa takin a lo thleng a, thu an sawi dual dualnaah chuan a tel ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, tûn hma lama amah lo hre tawhten zâwlneite thu sawi dual dualnaah a tel ve tih an hriat chuan, mite chu an inbia a, “Kisa fapa chunga thil lo awm hi eng nge ni ta? Saula pawh chu zâwlnei zîngah a tel ve ta elo maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a awmna khuaa mi pakhatin a chhâng a, “An pate chu tu nge maw an nih bîk le?” a ti a. Chutichuan, “Saula pawh chu zâwlnei a ni ve ta elo maw?” tih chu infiamna takah an hmang ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an thu sawi dual dualnaa a tel zawh chuan hmun sâng chu a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Saula pami chuan a hnênah leh a chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “Khawiah nge in kal?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Sabengtung kan zawng a; tin, kan hmuh zawh tâk loh avângin Samuela hnênah kan kal ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Saula pami chuan, “Samuela chuan i hnênah eng nge ni a sawi min hrilh teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan a pami hnênah chuan, “Sabengtungte chu an hmu tawh tih min hrilh teh meuh mai,” a ti a. Amaherawhchu, ram chungchâng thu Samuelan a sawi chu a hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan mipuite chu Mizpe-ah Lalpa hnênah a ko khâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, Israela thlahte hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Israel-ho chu Aigupta aṭangin ka hruai chhuak a, Aigupta mite kut ata leh a hnuaichhiahtu che u ram zawng zawng ata ka chhan chhuak che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, vawiinah hian in manganna zawng zawng leh hrehawmna zawng zawng ata chhanhimtu che u in Pathian ngei chu in duh lo va, a hnênah, “A ni lo ve, lal min siamsak rawh,” in ti a,’ tiin. Chuvângin, tûnah hian a hnama hnam leh a chia chiin Lalpa hmaah rawn inlan rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan Israel chi zawng zawng chu a rawn inlantîr a; tin, Benjamin chi chu thlan a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Benjamin chiho chu a chhûngkuain a rawn inlantîr a, Matri mi chhûng chu thlan a lo ni ta a. Tin, Kisa fapa Saula chu thlan a lo ni ta a. Nimahsela, amah an han zawng a, an hmu lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chu an han zâwt nawn leh a, “Mi lo kal tûr an la awm em?” an ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan a chhâng a, “Ngai teh u, bungraw zîngah a biru a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, an tlân a, an va hruai chhuak a; tin, mipui zînga a han din chuan mi zîngah chuan a sâng ber mai a, tu mah a koki khûm pawh an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan mi zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa mi ruat hi in hmu em? Mipui zawng zawng zîngah amah ang rêng rêng an awm lo ve,” a ti a. Tin, mipuite chu an au va, “Pathianin lalber humhim rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan mipuite chu ram awm dân tûr chu a hrilh a, lehkhabuah a ziak a, Lalpa hmaah chuan a dah a. Tin, Samuela chuan mipuite chu mahni in lam ṭheuhvah a hawtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Saula pawh chu Gibea khuaah a in lamah a haw ve ta a; tin, mi huaisenho, an thinlung Pathianin a khawihte chu a hnênah an kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Beliala fapa tute emaw chuan, “He mi hian engtin nge min chhandam theih tehlul ang?” an ti a. Tichuan, amah chu an ngainêp a, lâwmman rêng rêng an pe duh lo va. Nimahsela, ani chu a ngawi reng mai a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Amon mi Nahasa chu a lo thawk a, Jabes-gilead beih tumin a han ep a; tin, Jabes mi zawng zawng chuan Nahasa hnênah chuan, “Kan hnênah thu thlung la; tichuan, i rawng kan bâwl ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Amon mi Nahasa chuan an hnênah, “Hetiang hian a ni in hnênah thu ka thlun ang ni: in mit ding lam zawng zawng kher chhuah vek tûr a ni ang a; chu chu Israel mi zawng zawng tân hmingchhiatna a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Jabes khuaa upate chuan a hnênah, “Israel ram zawng zawngah mi kan han tirh rih theih nân ni sarih min ngaichâng rih rawh; chuta mi chhandam tûr tu mah an awm loh chuan i hnênah kan lo chhuak mai ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, an mi tirhte chuan Saula awmna khua Gibea chu an lo thleng a, mipuite beng hriatah chuan chûng thu chu an sawi a; tin, mipuite chuan an aw an chhuah a, an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, lo aṭangin Saula chu sebâwng khalhin a lo haw a; tin, Saula chuan, “Eng an ti nge ni mipuite chu an ṭah?” a ti a. Tin, Jabes khuaa mite thusawi chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu a hriat veleh chuan Saula chungah Pathian thlarau a lo thleng ta chiam mai a, nasa takin a thin chu a ur ta thut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, bâwng tuak khat a talh a, a sa chu a chan sawm vek a, Israel ram zawng zawngah chuan a semtîr a, “Tu pawh Saula leh Samuela rawn zui duh lo apiang an sebâwng chu hetianga tih ve hi a ni ang,” tiin. Chutichuan, mipuite chuan Lalpa chu an hlau ta a, thukhat vuain an lo thawk chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Bezek hmunah chuan a chhiar a; Israel mite chu nuai thum an ni a, Juda mite chu sîngthum an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, an mi rawn tirhte hnênah chuan, “Jabes-gilead mite hnênah chuan, ‘Naktûk ni lum vânglai tak hmain chhan chhuah in ni ang,’ va ti ang che u,” an ti a. Tin, an mi tirhte chu an va kal a, Jabes mite chu an hrilh a; tichuan, an lâwm ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jabes mite chuan, “Naktûkah hian in hnênah kan lo chhuak ang a, kan chungah in duh duhin ti mai ang che u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, a tûkah chuan Saula chuan mipuite chu pâwl thumah a siam a; tin, zîng vên hun lai takin an riahhmunah chuan an lût a, Amon mite chu chhûn ni sat vânglai tak thlengin an that a; tin, heti hi a ni a, an thah bângte chu an darh vek a, pahniha awm dûn rêng rêng pawh an awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan Samuela hnênah, “Tute nge ni, ‘Saulan kan chungah ro a rêl tehlul ang maw?’ ti kha? Chûng mite chu rawn hruai la, kan lo tihlum ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Vawiin kher hi chuan tu mah tihhlum tûr a ni lo ve; vawiinah hian Lalpa chuan Israel-te zîngah chhandamna a rawn thawk chhuak ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite hnênah chuan, “Hawh u, Gilgal-ah i kal ang u khai, chutah chuan ram chu i din thar leh ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui zawng zawng chu Gilgal-ah chuan an kal ta a, Saula chu Gilgal-ah chuan Lalpa hmaah lalah an siam ta a. Chutah chuan Lalpa hmaah remna inthawinate an hlân a; tichuan, chutah chuan Saula leh Israel mi zawng zawngte chu an lâwm ta êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Israel mite zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh u, ka hnêna in thusawi zawng zawng chu ka pawm a, lal tûr chu ka siamsak ta che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûnah hian ngai teh u, lal chuan a lo kaihruai ta che u a; kei chu ka lo tarin ka lû te pawh a lo ṭuak ta a, ngai teh u, ka fapate chu in hnênah an awm a. Ka tleirâwl lai aṭangin tûn thlengin ka kaihruai che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heta hi ka awm a. Lalpa hma leh a hriak thiha hmaah hian mi sêl teh u le: tu bâwngpa nge ka chhuhsak ngai? Tu sabengtung nge ka chhuhsak ngai? Tu nge ka bum tawh ngai? Tu nge ka tihduhdah ngai? Ka mit tidel tûrin tu lakah nge thamna ka lâk ngai? Ka rûl leh vek ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Min bum ngai lo va, min tiduhdah ngai hek lo, tu ma kut aṭangin lâk âwm loh i la ngai hek lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka kutah hian eng mah âwm lo in hmu lo tih vawiinah hian Lalpa chu in lakah hretu a ni a, a hriak thiha pawh chu hretu a ni,” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Amah chu hretu a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan mipui hnênah chuan, “Mosia leh Arona ruattu leh Aigupta ram ata in pute hruai chhuaktu Lalpa chu a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, ding ṭhap ula, Lalpa hmaah hian Lalpan in chungah leh in pute chunga thil a lo tihfel ṭhin dân ka han chhûtpui teh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta rama Jakoba a luh hnu khân, in pute chuan Lalpa an au va; tichuan, Lalpa chuan Mosia leh Arona a tîr a, anni chuan in pute chu Aigupta ram aṭangin an hruai chhuak a, he hmunah hian an awmtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa an Pathian chu an theihnghilh a, ani chuan Hazor sipai hotu Sisera kutah leh Philistia mite kutah leh Moab lal kutah a hralh a; tin, anni chuan an do va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu an au va, ‘ Lalpa chu kan hawisana, Baala-te leh Astorethi-te rawng kan bâwl avângin kan lo sual ta a ni; nimahsela, kan hmêlmate kut ata hi min chhan chhuak tawh la; tichuan, i rawng kan bâwl ang e,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Jerubaala te, Bedana te, Jephtha te, Samuela te a tîr a, in hmêlma lehlam lehlam mite kut ata a chhan chhuak che u a, him takin in awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahte lal Nahasa chu nangmahni do tûrin a lo kal tih in hriat veleh ka hnênah, ‘A ni lo ve, lalin ro min rêl rawh se,’ in ti a; Lalpa in Pathian chu in lal a ni reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, in lal, in thlan leh dîl chu en teh u; en teh u, Lalpa chuan lal a siamsak ta che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chu in ṭiha, a rawng in bâwla, a aw in ngaihthlâka, Lalpa thupêk in helsan lohva, nangmahni leh in chunga rorêltu lal nên Lalpa in Pathian zuitu in nih chuan a ṭha ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />amaherawhchu, Lalpa aw chu ngaithla lova, Lalpa thupêk in helsan chuan, in puten Lalpa kut an tuar ang bawkin nangni pawhin in tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, ding ṭhap ula, Lalpan in mit hmuha thil ropui tak a tih tûr hi lo en rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vawiin hian buh an seng a ni lâwm ni? Khawpui rîktîr tûr leh ruah sûrtîr tûrin Lalpa chu ka au vang a; tichuan, lal in dil thûah hian Lalpa mit hmuha thil in tihsual hi a nasatzia in hriain in hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan Lalpa chu a au va, Lalpa chuan chumi ni chuan khawpui a rîktîr a, ruah a sûrtîr a; tichuan, mipui chuan Lalpa leh Samuela chu an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan Samuela hnênah chuan, “Kan thih loh nân Lalpa i Pathian hnênah chuan i chhiahhlawhte hi min ṭawngṭaisak rawh; he thil ṭha lo tak, lal kan lo dîl hi, kan sual zawng zawng belhchhahtu a nih tâk hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan mipuite hnênah chuan, “Hlau suh u; he thil ṭha lo tak hi tih zawng in ti ngei tak a; mahse, Lalpa in zui chu pênsan chuang lo ula, in thinlung zawng zawngin Lalpa rawng chu bâwl zâwk rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />eng maha hnemhnâng lo tûr leh chhan chhuak thei lo che u zuiin pênsan suh u, eng mah lo an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hming ropui tak avâng hian Lalpa chuan a mite chu a hawisan dâwn si lo va; a mite atâna siam che u chu Lalpa lâwm zâwng tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu chang pawh a ni lo va, in tâna ṭawngṭai bâna, Lalpa chunga sual chu keia tân chuan a hnai lo tawp mai a ni; kawng ṭha leh kawng dik ka kawhhmuh zêl zâwk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa chu ṭih phawt mai ula, in thinlung zawng zawngin tihtak zetin a rawng bâwl ula; in tân thil a tih ropuizia hi ngaihtuah rawh u khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, sual taka thil in la tih cheu chuan in boral ang, nangmahni leh in lal nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula chu kum sawmthum mi a nihin a lal ṭan a; tin, Israel-hote chungah kum ... hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Israel-ho zînga mi sângthum a thlang a: sânghnih chu Mikmas-ah leh Bethel tlângah Saula hnênah an awm a; tin, sângkhat chu Benjamin rama Gibea-ah Jonathana hnênah an awm a; tin, a dang zawng zawng chu anmahni puan inah a hawtîr vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan Gibea-a Philistia râlvêngtu sipaiho a bei a; chu chu Philistia mite chuan an lo hria a. Tichuan, Saula chuan, “Hebrai mite khân lo hre rawh se,” tiin an ram zawng zawngah chuan tawtawrâwt a hamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho zawng zawngte chuan, Saula chuan Philistia râlvêngtu sipaihote a bei tih leh, Israel-hote pawhin Philistia mite huat an phur a ni tih thûte an lo hre ta a. Chutichuan, mipuite chu Saula hnênah Gilgal-ah an pung khâwm ta chiam mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chu Israel-ho bei tûr chuan an inpun khâwm ta chiam a; tawlailîr sîngthum, sakawr chung chuang mi sângruk, mihring tuifinriat kama ṭiau zât zeta tam an ni; tin, an chho va, Beth-aven chhak lampangah Mikmas-ah chuan ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan hnawhchêpin an awm tih an inhriat chuan (mite chu an mangang ta hle mai a) mite chu pûkah te, hnim hnawkah te, lungpui phênah te, kulhah te, khuarkhurumah te an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hebrai mi ṭhenkhatte chu Jordan râlah Gad leh Gilead ramahte an tlân a; Saula erawh chu Gilgal-ah a la awm reng a, mipuite chuan khûr zawih zawih chungin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samuelan ni a ruat angin ni sarih a awm a; nimahsela, Samuela chu Gilgal-ah chuan a la kal ta lo va; tichuan, mipuiin an tlân darhsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Hâlral thilhlan tûr leh remna thilhlan tûrte chu hetah ka hnênah han la rawh u,” a ti a. Chutichuan, hâlral thilhlan chu a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, hâlral thilhlan a hlân zo chauh va, Samuela chu a lo thleng ta a; tin, Saula chu chibai bûk tûrin amah hmuakin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan, “Eng nge ni i lo tih chu le?” a ti a. Tin, Saula chuan, “Mipuite chuan mi kal bosan tawh a; tin, nang lah chu ni ruat nîah chuan i lo thleng ta lo va; tin, Philistia mite lah chu Mikmas-ah an pung khâwm luih tawh tih ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, ‘Philistia mite chuan Gilgal-ah min rawn bei dâwn ṭêp si a; tin, Lalpa khawngaihna ka la dîl si lo,’ ka ti a. Chuvâng chuan, hâlral thilhlân chu hlân lo thei ka ni lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Saula hnênah chuan, “I thiltih dân hi a âtthlâk hle mai. Lalpa i Pathian thupêk, thu a pêk che hi i zâwm lo a ni. Lalpa chuan Israel-te chungah hian i lalna hi kumkhuaa tihngheh tum zawng a ni a le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, i lalna chu a kin tawh ang; Lalpa thupêk che i zawm loh avângin. Lalpa chuan ama thinlung ang pu mi a zawng a, a mite chunga hotu ni tûrin Lalpan a ruat tawh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chu a tho va, Gilgal ata chu Benjamin rama Gibea khuaah chuan a han kal ta a. Tin, Saula chuan a hnêna mi awmte chu a chhiar a, zaruk lai an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Saula leh a fapa Jonathana leh an hnêna mi awmte chu Benjamin rama Gibea khuaah chuan an awm a; nimahsela, Philistia mite chuan Mikmas-ah chuan ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lamthamhote chu Philistia mite ṭanhmun aṭangin pâwl thumin an lo chhuak a. Pâwl khatte chuan Shual rama Ophra lam pan kawng chu an zawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />pâwl khat dang chuan Beth-horon lam pan kawng an zawh a, pâwl khat chuan thlalêr dep Zeboim ruam lam hawi ramri kawng chu an zawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel-ho ram pum puiah chuan thîrdêngrêng rêng an awm lo va; Philistia mite chuan, “Hebrai mite hian khandaihte emaw, feite emaw an siam dah reu reu ang e,” an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Israel mi zawng zawngte chu bâwngtuthlawh te, leilehna thîr hriam te, thîrkut te, hreipui te, tiang hmâwra zum te a bil chuan an leilehna hmâwr zum te, an leilehna thîr hriam te, an hreipui te, an bâwngtuthlawhte tah hriamtîr tûrin Philistia-hote hnênah an zuk chhuk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, an indo ni chuan Saula leh Jonathana hnêna mi awmte chu khandaih emaw, fei emaw nei rêng rêng an awm lo va; Saula leh a fapa Jonathana erawh chuan an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Philistia râlvêngtu sipaiho chu Mikmas kâwnah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni khat chu Saula fapa Jonathana chuan a râlthuam kengtu tlangvâl hnênah chuan, “Hawh teh, lehlam râl Philistia mi râlvêngtu sipaiho awmnaah sâwn i va kal teh ang,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a pa chu a hrilh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Saula chu Gibea ram hmâwr lam daiha Migron-a pawmgranet thei kûng hnuaiah a awm a; tin, a hnêna mi awmte chu zaruk emaw lai an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Silo khuaa Lalpa puithiam Elia fapa Phinehasa fapa Ikaboda unaupa, Ahituba fapa Ahija chu puithiam kawr hain a awm ve a. Tin, Jonathana chu a kal tih mipuite chuan an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jonathanan Philistia mi râlvêngtu sipaiho awmnaa kal a tumna kâwn leh kâwn inkârah chuan, a lehlam lehlamah chuan lungpui tohlâwt a awm a: a pakhata hming chu Bozez a ni a, pakhata hming chu Sene a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lung tohlâwt pakhat chu Mikmas zâwn hmâr lampanga awm a ni a, a dang pakhat chu Gibea zâwn chhim lampanga awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan a râlthuam kengtu tlangvâl hnênah chuan, “Hawh, serhtan lohho sipaite awmnaah sâwn i kal teh ang; Lalpa chuan thil min tihsak mial mahna. Lalpa tân chuan a tam emaw, a tlêm emawa chhandam chu eng mah theih lohna a awm ve chuang si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a râlthuam kengtu chuan a hnênah, “I rilrua awm ang tak chuan ti rawh; ngai teh, i rilru chiah chu ka rilru a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana chuan, “Hawh teh, an hnênah sâwn kan va kal kai ang a, kan va inlan ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, kan hnêna, ‘In hnênah kan lo kal hma loh chuan lo awm rawh u,’ min tih chuan kan hmunah chuan kan ding reng ang a, an hnênah kan chho lo vang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Kan hnên lamah hian lo chho rawh u,’ an tih erawh chuan kan chho vang a. Lalpan kan kutah min pe tawh a ni tih kan tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an pahnihin Philistia mi râlvêngtu sipaite hmuhah chuan an va inlan a; tin, Philistia-hote chuan, “En teh u, Hebrai mite an bihrûkna khuarkhurum ata an lo chhuak ta,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, râlvêngtu sipaiho awmnaa mite chuan Jonathana leh a râlthuam kengtu chu, “Lo chho ula, thil eng emaw kan lo entîr ang che u,” tiin an lo au va. Tin, Jonathana chuan a râlthuam kengtu hnênah chuan, “Mi rawn zui chho rawh khai; Lalpa chuan anni chu Israel-hote kutah a pe ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Jonathana chu a kut leh ke thawhin a lâwn chho va, a râlthuam kengtu chuan a zui a; tin, anni chu Jonathana hmaah chuan an tlu zawih zawih a, a râlthuam kengtu chuan a rawn that ve zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana leh a râlthuam kengtuin an thah hmasak ber ṭum chuan ṭîn chanve hmun emaw vêl tûrah hian mi sawmhnih emaw lai an that a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an riahhmuna mi te, phûla mi te, mipui zawng zawngte chu an khûr a. Râlvêngtu sipaite leh lamthamhote pawh chu an khûr ve a; tin, lîr a nghîng a; chutichuan, namên lova khurhna a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Benjamin ram Gibea-a Saula râlvêngtute chuan an han thlîr vêl a, ngai teh, mipuite chu an ṭeh darh hum hum a, lehlam lehlamah an chavai nuaih nuaih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a hnêna mipui awmte hnênah chuan, “Tûnah hian inchhiar ula, tute nge kim lo han en teh u khai,” a ti a. Tin, an han inchhiar chuan ngai teh, Jonathana leh a râlthuam kengtu chu an lo awm ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Ahija hnênah chuan, “Pathian bâwm chu han la rawh khai,” a ti a. Chumi lai chuan Pathian bâwm chu Israela thlahte hnêna awm a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Saulan puithiam a biak lai mêk te chuan Philistia mite riahhmun lama buai mur mur chu a zual ta deuh deuh mai a; tin, Saula chuan puithiam hnênah, “I kut la rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan Saula leh a hnêna mipui awm zawng zawngte chu an kal khâwm a, indonaah chuan an kal ta a; tin, ngai teh, anmahni leh anmahni khandaihin an inbei ta chiam a; tichuan, an buai ta nuaih nuaih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, chûng lai ram vêla mi riahhmuna han kal ve, tûn hma lama Philistia-ho lama ṭang Hebrai mite pawh chu, Saula leh Jonathana hnêna awm Israel mite lamah chuan an lo pakai leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Ephraim tlâng rama Israel mi biru zawng zawngte pawh khân Philistia mite an tlân bo tih an lo hria a, anni pawh chuan indonaah tel vein an ûm zui ve ta ngat ngat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan chumi ni chuan Israel-hote chu a chhan him ta a; tin, Beth-aven thleng rawkin an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan Israel mite chu an mangang a; nimahsela, Saula chuan, “Kan hmêlmate chunga phuba ka lâka, khua a lo tlai lam hmaa tu pawhin chaw a ei chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,” tiin mipuite chu a vau va. Chutichuan, tu mahin chaw rêng rêng a tem pawh an tem miah lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawngte chuan ramhnuai an va thleng a, leiah chuan khawizu te a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, mipuiin ramhnuai an va thlen chuan ngai teh, khawizu te a lo luang a; nimahsela, tu mahin an pir lo, mipuite chuan chhechham chu an hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jonathana chuan a pain mipuite chu chhechhama a vau lai a hre ve lo va; chutichuan, a tiang ken hmâwr chu khawithlârah chuan a vit lût a, a pir a; tichuan, a mitmeng a lo fiah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui zînga mi pakhat chuan a bia a, “I pa chuan mipuiho hi, ‘Vawiina chaw ei apiang chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,’ tiin min vau tlat a, mipuite pawh an chau hle rêng mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana chuan, “Ka pa hian mite a timangang mai a nih hi maw! En ta che u, khawizu tlêm tê ka han tem mai avânga ka mitmeng a lo fiah tâkzia hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mipui hian an râllâk thil hi an hmuh apiang, vawiinah hian an duh duhin ei thei phei sela chu a va nasa lehzual dâwn êm! Chumi avâng chuan Philistia mite chu kan thah nasat theih loh phah a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi ni chuan Mikmas aṭangin Aijalon thlengin Philistia mite chu an bei a; tin, mipuite an chau ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chuan an râllâk thil chu a bawhin an bawh a, berâm te, sebâwngpa te, sebâwngno te an man a, leiah an tihlum a, mipuite chuan a thisen chawpin an ei ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, “Ngai teh, mipuite chuan thisen chawpa eiin Lalpa chungah thil an tisual ta,” tiin Saula chu an hrilh a. Tin, ani chuan, “Vervêk takin thil in ti a ni; vawiinah hian lung lian tak mi rawn lumsak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Mipui zîngah chuan vâk darh vek ula, an hnênah, ‘Mi tinin a sebâwng leh a berâm ka hnênah rawn la sela, hetah hian rawn talh sela, ei rawh se; a thisen chawpa eia Lalpa chungah thil tisual lovin, a ti e,’ va ti rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, chumi zân chuan mi zawng zawng chuan mahni bâwngpa an rawn kai ṭheuh va, chutah chuan an talh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a. Chu chu Lalpa tâna a maichâm siam hmasak ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Zânah Philistia mite zuk bei ila, zîng khaw ên thlengin i rawk ang u khai, tu mah rêng rêng i zuah suh ang u,” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Ṭha i tih ang apiangin ti rawh,” an ti a. Puithiam erawh chuan, “Heti laiah hian Pathian i hnaih teh rih ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Pathian a râwn a, “Philistia mite chu ka zuk bei ang em? Israel-ho kutah i pe ang em?” a ti a. Nimahsela, chumi ni chuan a chhâng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Nangni mipui hotu zawng zawngte chu lo hnai teh u khai, vawiinah hian a eng berah nge kan tihsual hriat chhuah tum teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel-hote chhandam ṭhîntu Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka fapa Jonathana thiltihah pawh lo ni sela, a thi ngei ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a. Nimahsela, mipui zînga mi chuan tu mah chhâng rêng rêng an awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-ho zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Nangniho hi a hrangin awm khâwm ula; tin, kei leh ka fapa Jonathana hi a hrangin kan awm ang e,” a ti a. Tin, mipuite chuan Saula hnênah, “Ṭha i tih ang apiangin ti rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saulan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian hnênah chuan, “A dik tak chu han tilang ang che,” a ti a. Tin, ṭhumvâwr chu Jonathana leh Saula chungah chuan a tlu a; mipuite erawh chu an fihlîm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Kei leh ka fapa Jonathana thlei nân ṭhum vâwr rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Jonathana chungah chuan a tlu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan Jonathana hnênah chuan, “Eng nge ni i tih min hrilh rawh khai,” a ti a. Tin, Jonathana chuan a hrilh a, “Ka tiang ken hmâwrin khawizu tlêm chu ka tem ngei mai a; ngai teh, ka thi ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Pathianin a tih tihin ti mai sela, chu aia nasa pawhin; i thi ngei ngei tûr a ni, Jonathan,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan Saula hnênah chuan, “Israel-te zîngah he chhandamna ropui tak thawktu Jonathana hi a thi ang maw? Hnai lo ve! Lalpa nunna chhâlin kan sawi e, a sam zai khat pawh hi leiah a tla hlek lo vang; vawiin hian Pathian a thawhpui a nih hi,” an ti a. Chutichuan, mipui chuan Jonathana chu thi lo tûrin an chhan him ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saulan Philistia mite a ûm chu a kîrsan ta a; tin, Philistia mite chu anmahni awm hmun lamah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula Israel-ho chunga rorêltua a han ṭan chuan kil tinah a hmêlma Moab-hote, Amona thlahte, Edom-hote, Zoba lalhote, Philistia mite chu a do va; a thlêkna lam apiang maiah chuan a hneh zêl mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Huai takin a bei a, Amalek mite chu a hneh a, Israel-ho chu anmahni rawktute kut ata a chhan chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Saula fapate chu Jonathana te, Isvia te, Malkisua te an ni a. Tin, a fanute pahnih hming chu hêng hi a ni: a upa zâwk hming chu Merabi a ni a, a naupang zâwk hming chu Mikali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Saula nupui hming chu Ahinoami, Ahimaaza fanu a ni. Tin, a sipaite hotu hming chu Abnera, Saula pami Nera fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kisa chu Saula pa a ni a; tin, Abnera pa Nera chu Abiela fapa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula dam chhûng zawng zawng chuan Philistia mite nên nasa tak maiin an indo ṭhîn a. Tin, Saula chuan mi chak emaw, mi huai emaw a hmuh apiang chu a la zêl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “ Lalpan a mite chungah, Israel-hote chunga lal atâna hriak thih tûr chein mi tîr a ni; chutichuan, Lalpa thusawi aw chu ngaithla teh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, ‘Amalek miten Israel-hote chunga an thiltih, Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah laia an lo dâl dânte kha ka chhinchhiah reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amalek-hote bei tûrin kal la, an thil neih zawng zawng zuah rêng rêng nei lovin tiboral vek rawh; a hmei a pa leh nausên te, hnute hne lai te, bâwngpa te, berâm te, sanghâwngsei te, sabengtung te nên tihlum vek ang che,’ a ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan mipuite a ko khâwm a, Telaim khuaah a chhiar a, sipai nuai hnih leh Juda mi sîngkhat an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Amalek-ho khua chu a zuk thleng a, ruamah chuan a lo lambun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Ken-hote hnênah chuan, “Lo chhuak ula, Amalek-hote zîng ata hi inthiarfihlîm rawh u; chuti lo chuan, ka tihlum tel dah ang che u. Nangni zawngin Israela thlahte zawng zawng Aigupta ram aṭanga an lo chhuak kha in lo khawngaih si a,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Ken-hote chu Amalek mite zîng ata an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan Amalek mite chu Havila aṭanga Aigupta ram dep Sur thlengin a bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Amalek mite lal Agaga chu a nungin a man a, mipui zawng zawngte chu khandaihin a sât hlum vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Saula leh mipuite chuan Agaga chu an zuah a, berâm ṭha ṭha te, bâwngpa ṭha ṭha te, a thau thau te, berâmno te, a ṭha zawng zawngte nên, chûngte chu an tihlum duh lo va; a ṭha lo leh an duh loh apiang erawh chu an tihlum vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thu chu Samuela hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saula lala ka lo ruat ta chu ka inchhîr a ni, a mi zui lai chu mi hnuchhawnin ka thupêk angin a ti si lo va,” a ti a. Tin, Samuela chu a thinur a, zankhuain Lalpa chu a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chu Saula hmuak tûrin zîng takah a tho va; tin, “Saula chu Karmel-ah a kal a; ngai teh, chutah chuan hriat rengna lung a phun a; tin, a kîr leh a, a kal zêl a, Gilgal-ah a chhuk ta,” tiin Samuela chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chu Saula hnên lamah chuan a kal ta a; tin, Saula chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpan malsâwm che rawh se! Lalpa thupêk ang chuan ka ti ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan, “Chûng berâm bê ka benga lo lût leh bâwngpa bû ka han hriatte chu eng tizia nge ni si?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Amalek mite ta an rawn lâksak a ni; Lalpa i Pathian hnênah inthawi nân mipuiten berâm ṭha ṭha leh bâwngpa ṭha ṭha an zuah a ni; tin, a dang zawng zawng chu kan tihlum vek a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “Ngawi rawh, nizâna Lalpan ka hnêna thu a sawi ka hrilh ang che,” a ti a. Ani chuan a hnênah, “Sawi rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan, “Nangma ngaihin mi tê tak ni mah la, Israel hnam hotu atâna a siam i ni lâwm ni? Tin, Lalpa chuan Israel-ho lal atân hriak a thih chia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, Lalpa chuan a tîr chhuak chia, ‘Kal la, mi sualho, Amalek mite chu tihlum vek la, an boral dêr hma loh chuan bei zêl rawh,’ a ti chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpa thu chu zâwm lova, râllâk thil chu a bawha i bawha, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo i tih mai?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Samuela hnênah, “E, Lalpa thu chu ka zâwm alâwm, Lalpa min tirhna lamah chuan ka kal a, Amalek lal Agaga ka rawn man a, Amalek mite chu ka tihlum vek alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mipuite chuan râllâk thil berâm leh bâwngpate tihboral tûr zînga a ṭha ṭhate chu, Gilgal khuaah Lalpa i Pathian hnênah inthawi nân an rawn la a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan, “ Lalpa chuan Lalpa thu zawm chu a lawm angin hâlral thilhlante leh inthawinate hi a lâwm em ni? Ngai teh, inthawina aiin thuawih chu a ṭha zâwk a, berâmpa thau aiin a thu pawm chu a ṭha zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Helna hi aienthiamna sual te nên a inang a, luhlulna hi milem biak leh pathian lem biak tluk a ni. Lalpa thu i duh loh avângin ani pawhin lal atân a duh ta bîk lo che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Samuela hnênah, “Thil ka tisual dêr mai a ni, Lalpa thupêk leh i thu chu ka lo bawhchhe reng mai a nih hi; mipuite ka hlauhva, an thu ka lo awihna lamah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka sual ngaidam la, Lalpa ka biak theih nân mi hawpui leh rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “Ka hawpui tawp lo vang che, Lalpa thu chu i duh si lo va; tin, Lalpa pawhin Israel-hote lal atân a duh ta bîk lo che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chu kal tûra a han her chuan Saula chuan a puan fêm chu a han chelh a, a thlêr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan a hnênah, “Vawiin aṭang hian Lalpan Israel ram hi a chhuhsak ta chia, i aia ṭha zâwk i ṭhenawm a pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Israel-te Thahruia chu a daw lo vang a, a inlamlêt hek lo vang. Mihring anga inlamlêt leh mai mi a ni si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chuan, “Ka lo sual ta a ni; nimahsela, ka mite zînga upaho leh Israel-hote hmaah hian mi chawimawi tûrin ka ngên a che; tin, Lalpa i Pathian chu ka biak theih nân mi hawpui leh hrâm ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan Saula chu a hawpui ta a, Saula chuan Lalpa chu a be ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan, “Amalek mite lal Agaga chu ka hnênah han hruai rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Agaga chu a hnênah chuan khûr chungin a va kal a. Tin, Agaga chuan, “Thihna kha chu ka pumpelh tawh a ni chêk ang chu maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan, “I khandaihin hmeichhiate fa nei lova a siam angin i nu pawh hmeichhe zînga fa nei lo mi a ni ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Samuela chuan Agaga chu Gilgal khuaah Lalpa hmaah chuan a sât sawm ta berh mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chu Rama khuaah a kal a; tin, Saula chu a inah Saula awmna khua Gibea-ah a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan a thih ni thlengin Saula chu a tlawh leh ta lo va. Samuela chu Saula avângin lungngaih chu a lungngai a ni; tin, Lalpa chu, Israel-te lal atâna Saula a lo siam chu a inchhîr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “Israel mite lal atân ka duh tawh loh ahnu, Saula avâng hian eng chen nge maw i lungngaih dâwn le? I kîah hriak thun khat la, kal rawh; Bethlehem mi Jesaia hnênah ka tîr dâwn che a ni. A fapate zînga mi lal atân ka ruat tawh reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan “Engtin nge ka kal theih ang? Saulan a lo hriat chuan min tihlum mai ang asin,” a ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Bâwnglâ hruai la, ‘ Lalpa hnêna inthawi tûra lo kal ka ni,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, inthawinaah chuan Jesaia chu ko la, i tih tûr chu ka hrilh ang chia; tin, a hming ka hrilh tûra che chu hriak min thihsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Samuela chuan Lalpa sawi ang chuan a ti a, Bethlehem-ah chuan a kal ta a. Tin, khuaa upate chuan khûr chungin amah an lo hmuak a, “Ṭha lam thûa lo kal em i nih le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ṭha lam thûah ni e; Lalpa hnêna inthawi tûra lo kal ka ni. Intithianghlim ula, inthawinaah lo kal ve rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, Jesaia leh a fapate chu a tithianghlim a, inthawinaah chuan a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, an lo kal chuan Eliaba chu a lo en a, “ Lalpa hriak thiha chu a hmaa awma hi a ni ngei mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa chuan Samuela hnênah, “A hmêl lam emaw, a sân lam emaw en suh; ani hi chu ka duh loh a ni. Lalpa chuan mihring en dân angin a en ve si lo va; mihring chuan pâwn lama lan dân an en ṭhîn a, Lalpa erawh chuan thinlung lam a en zâwk ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Jesaia chuan Abinadaba a han ko va, Samuela hmaah chuan a kaltîr a. Ani chuan, “Hei pawh hi Lalpa thlan a la ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Jesaia chuan Sama a va kaltîr leh a. Tin, ani chuan, “Hei pawh hi Lalpa thlan a la ni lo cheu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Jesaia chuan a fapate pasarih chu Samuela hmaah chuan a kaltîr a. Tin, Samuela chuan Jesaia hnênah, “ Lalpan hêngho hi a thlang lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Jesaia hnênah, “Hetah hian i fate an awm kim vek em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “A naupang ber a la awm a, ngai teh, berâm a vêng a ni,” a ti a. Tin, Samuela chuan Jesaia hnênah, “Va kohtîr rawh khai; a lo thlen hma loh chu kan ṭhu dâwn lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, a va kohtîr a, a rawn hruai a. Ani chu sâr veng vawng, mit meng mawi tak, hmêl ṭha tak mai a ni a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Tho la, hriak thih rawh; hei ngei hi a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela chuan hriak bâwm ki chu a la a, a unaute zîngah chuan amah chu hriak a thih a; tichuan, Lalpa thlarau chu chumi ni aṭang chuan nasa takin Davida chungah a lo thleng ta a. Chutichuan, Samuela chu a tho va, Rama khuaah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thlarau chuan Saula chu a chhuahsan a, Lalpa tirh ramhuaiin amah a tibuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Saula chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Pathian tirh ramhuaiin a tibuai che a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan pu chuan i chhiahhlawh i hmaa awmte ṭingṭang tum thiam tak zawn thu min pe rawh khai; tichuan, Pathian tirh ramhuaiin a man hun chein a tum ang a, i ṭha mai ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah chuan, “Tum thiam tak chu mi han zawnsak ula, ka hnênah rawn hruai rawh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, tlangvâl pakhat chuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Bethlehem mi Jesaia fapa pakhat chu ka hmu tawh a, chu mi chu tum thiam tak, mi huai tak, indo mi, thusawi thiam tak, hmêl ṭha tak a ni a, a hnênah Lalpa pawh a awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan Jesaia hnênah chuan mi a tîr a, “I fapa Davida, berâm vênga awm chu ka hnênah han kaltîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Jesaia chuan sabengtung, chhang leh uain peng khat phur leh kêlno a la a, a fapa Davida chu Saula pêkah a kentîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Saula hnên chu a va thleng a, a hmaah chuan a va ding a. Ani chuan a lo ngaina hle mai a, a râlthuam kengtuah a ṭang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Jesaia hnênah, “Davida hi ka hnênah awm rawh se, ka mit a tlung hle mai,” tia hrilh tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Pathian tirh ramhuaiin Saula a man apiangin Davida chuan ṭingṭang a la a, a tum ṭhîn a. Chutichuan, Saula chu a lo harh a, a ṭha leh ṭhîn a; tin, ramhuai chuan a chhuahsan ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chuan indo tûrin an sipaite an khâwm chiam mai a. Judai ram chhûng Soko khuaah an pung khâwm a, Ephes-damim hmunah Soko khua leh Azeka khaw inkârah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Saula leh Israel mite chu an pung khâwm a, Ela ruamah ṭanhmun an khuar a, Philistia mite lo dang tûrin an inzâr darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chu tlâng pangah an awm a; tin, Israel mite chu a lehlam tlâng pangah an awm a, an inkârah chuan ruam a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite ṭanhmun aṭang chuan an mi chak, a hming Goliatha, Gath khuaa mi, tawng ruk leh khâpa sâng hi a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dâr lukhum hi a khum a, âwmphaw a ha a; a âwmphaw rih lam chu dâr sekel sângnga a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ngalah chuan dâr ngalphaw a bun a, a hnungzângah chuan dâr feitê a pai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A fei ngul chu themkawl ang hi a ni a; tin, a fei lû chu thîr sekel zaruka rit a ni a; tin, a phaw kengtu chu a hmaah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a ding a, Israel sipaite chu a au va, an hnênah, “Engati nge indo tûra in rawn inzâr darh? Kei Philistia mi, nangni Saula chhiahhlawh in ni lâwm ni? Mi inthlang ula, ka hnênah lo chhuk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi beih theiha mi tihhlum chuan in chhiahhlawhah kan awm ang a; amaherawhchu, keiin ka ngama ka tihhlum chuan kan chhiahhlawhah in awm ang a, kan rawng in bâwl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mi chuan, “Vawiinah hian Israel-ho sipaite chu ka cho a ni; mi pakhat han thawh ula, kan lo inbei ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Saula leh Israel-ho zawng zawngin chu Philistia mi thusawi chu an han hriat chuan an zâm a, an hlau ta êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu Jesaia fapa a ni a, ani chu Bethlehem-juda-a Ephrath mi kha a ni a, fapa pariat a nei a; ani chu Saula lal lai chuan upa tak, tar tak a ni tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Jesaia fapa upate pathum chuan indonaah Saula chu an zui a. A fapate pathum indonaa kalte hming chu a upa ber Eliaba te, a dawttu Abinadaba te, a pathumna Sama te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a naupang ber a ni a; tin, a upate pathum chuan Saula an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chu Saula hnên aṭangin Bethlehem-ah a pa berâm enkawlin a va kal a va kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mi chuan zîng leh tlai apiangah hian a va hnaih ṭhîn a, ni sawmli chhûng a va intâr lang ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jesaia chuan a fapa Davida hnênah chuan, “Vai epha khat leh he chhang hlâwm sâwm hi keng la, i unaute hnênah an riah hmunah va kalpui thuai rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, bâwnghnute khal tlang sâwm hi an pâwla sâng hotu kensak la; tin, i unaute engtin nge an awm han zâwt la, an chanchin han hria ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saula leh anni leh Israel mi zawng zawngte chu Philistia mite beiin Ela ruamah chuan an awm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu zîng takah a tho va, berâmte chu vêngtu pakhat a kawltîr a, Jesaian thu a pêk ang chuan a keng a, a kal ta a; tin, indona hmuna chhuak mêk sipaihote chu inbei tûra an lo au dur dur lai takin ani chuan tawlailîr awmna hmun chu a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho leh Philistia mite chu inbei tûrin an lo inzâr a, sipai leh sipai chu an lo inep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a bungrua chu bungraw enkawltu hnênah chuan a dah a, sipai hnên lamah chuan a va tlân a, a ute chu chibai a va bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, anmahni a biak lai chuan ngai teh, an mi chak Gath khuaa Philistia mi, a hming Goliatha chu Philistia mite sipai pâwl zîng ata a lo chhuak a, a thusawi ngai bawk kha a han sawi a. Chu chu Davida chuan a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Israel mi zawng zawngte chuan chu mi chu an han hmuh chuan an tlânchhia a, an hlau êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan, “Kha mihring lo chhuaka kha in hmu em? Israel mite cho tûrin a lo chhuak a ni ngei mai; tu pawh amah tihlum apiang chu lalin nasa takin sum lamin a tihausa ang a, a fanu a pe ang a; tin, a pa chhûngkua chu Israel-ho zîngah hian chhiah a âwl ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a kianga dingte hnênah chuan, “He Philistia mi hi tihluma Israel-ho hmingchhiatna tirehtu chu engtia tih tûr nge ni ang? He serhtan loh Philistia mi hi tu nge maw a niha, Pathian nung sipaite a han cho vei le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan hetiang hian an chhâng a, “A tihlumtu apiang chu kan sawi ang khân tih a ni ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, a u upa ber Eliaban mite hnêna a thusawi lai chu a lo hria a; tichuan, Eliaba chu Davida chungah chuan a thin a ur ta thut a. “Engah nge i lo chhuk ve ni? Thlalêra berâm tlêm awmte kha tu nge i vêntîr ni? I chapozia leh i rilru ṭhat lohzia ka hria a ni; indo en tûr tein i lo kal mai mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Eng nge maw ka tih le? A chhan a awm a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan mi dang hnên lam a hawisan a, a sawi ngai bawk a sawi a; tin, mipuite chuan a hmaa an chhân ang bawkin an chhâng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Davida thusawi chu an hriatin Saula hnênah an sawi chhâwng a; tin, ani chuan a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “Amah avâng chuan tu ma rilru zâm suh se; i chhiahhlawh hian chu Philistia mi chu ka va bei ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “Nang zawng chu Philistia mi bei tûr chuan i kal thei êm lo vang e; tleirâwl chauh i la ni si a, ani zawng a tleirâwl tirh ata indo mi a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh hian ka pa berâm ka vêng ṭhîn a; sakeibaknei emaw, savawm emaw a lo kala berâm rual zîng ata berâmno a lâk te hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ka ûm a, ka bei a, a kâ ata chu ka chhan chhuak ṭhîn asin; tin, mi bei tûra a lo thawh te hian a bak hmulah ka man a, ka bei a, ka tihlum ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hian sakeibaknei leh savawmte ka tihlum ve ve tawh ṭhîn a; chu serhtan loh Philistia mi chu anmahni angin a awm ve mai ang maw le, Pathian nung sipaite a cho vei a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Sakeibaknei kutbâwr ata leh savawm kutbâwr ata mi chhan chhuaktu Lalpa chuan chu Philistia mi kut ata chu mi chhan chhuak ang,” a ti a. Tin, Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “Kal teh le, i hnênah Lalpa a awm ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida chu ama thuam a bel a, dâr lukhum a khumtîr a, âwmphaw a hâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a thuam chungah chuan a khandaih a pai a, kal a han tum a; chutiang chuan a la tichhin ngai si lo va. Tin, Davidan Saula hnênah, “Ka kalpui thei dâwn hauh lo mai! Hetiang hian ka la tichhin ngai lo a ni,” a ti a. Tichuan, Davida chu a inhlîp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a tiang chu a keng a, luitêa lung mûm mâm thel thawl panga a thlang a, a berâm vên ip, a iptêah chuan a pai a; tin, a virvawm chu a keng a, Philistia mi chu a va pan hnai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mi chu a lo kal zêl a, Davida chu a rawn pan hnai a; tin, phaw kengtu chu a hmaah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mi chu a han hawi vêl a, Davida chu a han hmuh chuan a hmusit hle mai a; sâr veng vawng, mitmeng mawi tak, tleirâwl mai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia mi chuan Davida hnênah chuan, “Ui emaw ka niha tiangte nêna mi rawn pan chu le?” a ti a. Tichuan, Philistia mi chuan a pathiante chhâlin Davida chu ânchhia a lawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mi chuan Davida hnênah, “Lo kal teh, i sate kha chunglêng savate leh ramsate ka lo eitîr teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Philistia mi hnênah chuan, “Nang zawng khandaih te, fei te, feitê te kengin i lo thawk a; kei zawng sipaite Lalpa , Israel sipaite Pathian, i chova hmingin ka lo thawk zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Vawiinah hian Lalpan nang hi ka kutah mi pe dâwn a ni; tin, ka that ang chia, i lû ka tansak ang che. Tin, Philistia sipaiho ruangte chu vawiinah hian chunglêng savate leh ramsate ka eitîr dâwn a ni; chutichuan, lei chunga mi zawng zawng hian Israel-ho zîngah hian Pathian a awm tih an hre thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, heta pungho zawng zawng hian Lalpa chuan khandaih leh feiin a chhandam lo tih an hre thei ang a; indona chu Lalpa indona a ni si a, ani chuan nangniho hi kan kutah mi pe dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Philistia mi chu a lo thawha Davida bei tûra a rawn hnaih chuan, Davida chu sipaiho lamah chuan Philistia mi chu bei tûrin a tlân ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a ip chu a han zen a, lung a han phawrh a, a virvawm chuan a han vawm a, Philistia mi chu a chaldâr takah a han vawm a, a chalah chuan lung chu a lût a, a tlu bawkkhup ta dêr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Philistia mi chu virvawm leh lungin a ngam a, Philistia mi chu a vawm a, a that ta a; Davida chuan khandaih a keng hauh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu a tlân a, Philistia mi kiangah chuan a va ding a, a khandaih chu a la a, a pai ata chu a phawi a, chu chuan a that a, a lû a tan ta a. Tin, Philistia miten an mi chak chu a thi tih an hriatin an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Israel mi leh Juda mite chu an tho va, an au va, Philistia mite chu Gath thleng leh Ekron kulh kawngkhâr thleng rawkin an ûm ta a. Tin, Philistia mite zînga hliamho chu Saaraim kawng tluanin Gath leh Ekron thlengin an tlu rum mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Philistia mite an ûm chu an kirsan a, an riahhmun chu an suan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Philistia mi lû chu a la a, Jerusalem-ah a kalpui a, râlthuam erawh chu a puan inah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Saulan Philistia mi bei tûra Davida kal a hmuh khân sipai hotu Abnera hnênah chuan, “Abner, he tleirâwl hi tu fa nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, Abnera chuan, “I nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, aw lalpa, ka hre hauh lo mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “He naupang hi tu fa nge ni zâwt chhuak rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, Davida, Philistia mi a that lo haw chu Abnera chuan a hruai a, Philistia mi lû keng chungin Saula hnênah chuan a kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan a hnênah, “Tu fapa nge i nih le tlangvâl?” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan a chhâng a, “Bethlehem mi i chhiahhlawh Jesaia fapa ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Saula hnêna thu a sawi zawh chuan Jonathana nunna leh Davida nunna chu a lo inzawm ta chiah mai a; tichuan, Jonathana chuan ama nunna a hmangaih ang chiahin a hmangaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan chumi ni chuan a awmtîr ta nghâl a, a pa inah a hâwntîr phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana leh Davida chuan thu an thlung a, ama nunna ang chiaha a hmangaih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan a puan sin lai a hlîp a, Davida a pe a, a thuam leh a khandaih leh a thal ngul leh a tai hrênna lamin a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Saulan a tirhna apiangah Davida chu a kal ṭhîn a, fel takin a che ṭhîn a. Tin, Saula chuan râl kâp mite hotu atân a siam a, chu chu mi zawng zawng ngaihah leh Saula chhiahhlawhte ngaihah pawh a ṭha êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, an lo hâwna, Davida chu Philistia mi thata a lo haw chuan, Israel khaw tinah hmeichhiate chu hla sa leh lâm chungin khuangtê leh thil ri theite nên, hlim takin Lal Saula hmuak tûrin an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhiate chu lâm chungin hlain an inchhâwn a, “Saulan a sânga sâng a that, Davidan a sînga sîng,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chu a thinur ta viau mai a, chûng thu chuan a tilâwm lo hle mai a; “Davida chu a sînga sîng thatah an ngai a, kei erawh chu a sânga sâng chauh thatah mi ngai a. Ram tih ngawt loh chu a neih tûr dang eng nge awm tawh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan chumi ni aṭang chuan Davida chu a hmumawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah chuan Saula chungah chuan Pathian tirh ramhuai a lo thleng ta chiam mai a, in chhûngah chuan thu a sawi ta bual bual mai a. Tin, Davida chuan ni danga a tih ang bawkin ṭingṭang a tum a; Saula chuan a fei a keng reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan fei chu a han lek a, “Bangah sâwn Davida saw ka khawh bet tlat teh ang,” a ti a. Davida chuan vawi hnih a kiansan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah Lalpa a awm avâng leh, Saula chu a kalsan avângin Saula chuan Davida chu a hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Saula chuan a hnên aṭangin a insawntîr a, sâng chunga a sipai hotuah a siam a; tin, mipui zîngah chuan a lûtin a chhuak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a thiltih apiangah fel takin a che ṭhîn a; Lalpa chu a hnênah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan fel takin a che ṭhîn tih a hmuhin a hlau hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Israel-ho leh Juda-ho zawng zawngte chuan Davida chu an ngaina êm êm a; an zînga lûta chhuak ṭhîn a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “Ngai teh, ka fanu upa zâwk Merabi hi i nupuiah ka neihtîr ang che; huai takin mi ṭan phawt mai la, Lalpa indonate chu do vang che,” a ti a. Saula chuan, “Kei chuan a chunga kut thlâk lovin Philistia miten a chungah kut thlâk zâwk rawh se,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “Tu nge maw ka niha, ka nunna leh Israel-te zînga ka pa chhûngte pawh eng nge maw an niha, lal mâkpa ka han nihna tûr chu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, heti hi a ni a, Saula fanu Merabi chu Davida neihtîr a lo hun chuan, Meholath mi Adriela nupui atân a pe ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Saula fanu Mikali chuan Davida chu a hmangaih a. Saula chu an hrilh a, chu chuan a tilâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “A awhna thang a lo nih theih nân leh, Philistia miten a chungah kut an thlâk theih nân ani hi ka pe teh ang,” a ti a. Chuvâng chuan Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “Vawiinah hian ka mâkpa i ni nawn leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a chhiahhlawhte chu thu a pe a, “A rûk têin Davida bia ula, ‘Ngai teh, lal chu i chungah a lâwm hle mai a, a chhiahhlawh zawng zawng pawhin an hmangaih che a ni; chutichuan, lal mâkpaah awm ang che,’ ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Saula chhiahhlawhte chuan chûng thu chu Davida beng hriatah an sawi a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Mi rethei leh tu ma ngaihsân mang loh keini ang tân hian lal mâkpa han nih chu thil namênah in ngai em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Saula chhiahhlawhte chuan, “Davida chuan chutiang chuan a ti a ni,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Davida hnênah hetiang hian sawi ang che u, ‘Lal chuan lal hmêlma phuba lâk nân Philistia mite serh vun za tih loh chu man eng mah a duh lo ve, a ti,’ ti rawh u,” a ti a. Saula chuan Davida chu Philistia mite kuta thihtîr a rilrûk tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawhten chûng thu chu Davida an han hrilh chuan, lal mâkpa a han ni tûr chu Davida chu a lâwm hle mai a. Tin, ni tiam te chu a la ral lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tichuan, Davida leh a mite chu an tho va, Philistia mite chu zahnih an va that a. Tin, Davida chuan an serh vun a rawn hâwn a, lal mâkpa a nih theihna tûrin lal chu kim takin an pe a. Tichuan, Saula chuan a fanu Mikali chu nupuiah a neihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida hnênah chuan Pathian a awm tih a hre chiang ta a; tin, Saula fanu Mikali chuan ani chu a hmangaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula chuan Davida chu a hlau zual ta sauh mai a. Saula chu Davida hmêlma a ni ta kumkhua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia-ho mi liante chu an va thawk chhuak ṭhîn a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, an thawh chhuah apiangin Davida chu Saula chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte aia felin a che ṭhîn a; tichuan, a hming chu an chawisâng ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a fapa Jonathana leh a chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte chu Davida that tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nimahsela, Saula fapa Jonathana chuan Davida chu a ngaina hle mai a. Tichuan, Jonathana chuan Davida chu, “Ka pa Saula hian thah a tum chia; chuvângin, naktuk zîngah chuan fîmkhur la, hmun biruah biru reng rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka kal chhuak ang a, i awmna phûlah ka pa kiangah ka va ding ang a, i chungchâng thûah ka pa ka bia ang a. Tin, eng emaw ka hriat chuan ka hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan a pa Saula hmaah chuan Davida chu a fak a, a hnênah, “Lal chuan a chhiahhlawh chungah, Davida chungah hian thil sual ti lul suh se, i chungah eng mah a tisual si lo va, a thiltihte chu i tâna ṭha tak a ni zâwk si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thih dâwn lovin Philistia mi kha a bei a; tin, Lalpan Israel-ho zawng zawng chhandamna ropui tak a thawh chhuahsak a. Chu chu nang pawhin i hmu a, i lâwm hle kha. Chuvângin, thisen pawi khawih lo chungah chuan engah tehlul nge thil i tihsual anga, a chhan eng mah awm lovin Davida chu i thah ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan Jonathana thusawi chu a pawm a, Saula chuan chhechhamin, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ani chu tihhlum tûr a ni tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan Davida chu a ko va, Jonathana chuan chûng thil zawng zawng chu a hrilh a. Tin, Jonathana chuan Davida chu Saula hnênah chuan a hruai a, tûn hma lam ang bawk khân a hnênah a awm leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, indona a lo awm leh a; tichuan, Davida chu a thawk chhuak a, Philistia mite chu a va bei a, a va that chiam a, a hmaah chuan an tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Saula chu a ina fei kenga a ṭhut laiin Lalpa tirh ramhuai a chungah a lo thleng a; tin, Davida chuan ṭingṭang a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan a fei chuan Davida chu banga khawh beh tlat a tum a; nimahsela, Saula kiang ata chu a pût chhuak var a, fei chu bangah chuan a khawh bûr ta ngur mai a; tin, Davida chu a tlân chhuak a, chumi zân chuan a him ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida in lamah zînga lo chânga that tûrin mi a tîr a; tin, Davida nupui Mikali chuan, “Zâninah hian i nun i humhim loh zawngin naktûkah an that dâwn che a ni,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mikali chuan Davida chu tukverhah a thlâk thla a; tichuan, a tlân bo va, a him ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mikali chuan milem a la a, khumah chuan a muttîr a; tin, a lû lamah chuan kêl hmul lukham a dah a, puanin a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida hruai tûra Saulan mi a rawn tirh chuan, “A damlo,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida va en tûrin mi a tîr a, “A khum chawpin rawn zâwn chho ula, ka lo that ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a mi tirhte chu an va luh chuan ngai teh, khumah chuan milem chu a lû lama kêl hmul lukham khamin a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Mikali hnênah, “Engati nge hetianga mi buma, a himna tûra ka hmêlma i chhuahtîr ni?” a ti a. Tin, Mikali chuan Saula chu a chhâng a, “Ka kaltîr loh chuan mi thah a tum alâwm maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu a tlân bo va, a him ta a, Rama khuaah Samuela hnên a va thleng a, a chunga Saula thiltih zawng zawng chu a hrilh a. Tin, amah leh Samuela chu an kal a, Naioth-ah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Saula chu, “Ngai teh, Davida chu Rama khuaa Naioth-ah a awm,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida hruai tûrin Saula chuan mi a tîr a. Tin, zâwlnei pâwlho thusawi dual dual lai leh Samuela chu an chunga hotua awm an va hmuh chuan, Saula mi tirhte chungah chuan Pathian thlarau a lo thleng a, anni pawh chuan thu an sawi ve ta dual dual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Saula an han hrilh chuan, mi dang a tîr leh a, anni pawh chuan thu an va sawi ve leh ta dual dual mai a. Tin, Saula chuan a vawi thumnaah chuan mi a tîr leh a, anni pawh chuan thu an va sawi ve leh ta dual dual mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, amah pawh chu Rama khuaah chuan a kal ve ta a; tin, Seku hmuna tuichhunchhuah zau tak chu a va thleng a, “Samuela leh Davida hi khawiah nge an awm?” a ti a, a zâwt a. Tin, tu emaw hian, “Ngai teh, Rama khuaa Naioth-ah an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Rama khuaa Naioth-ah a kal a; tin, Pathian thlarau chu a chungah chuan a lo thleng ve ta a, a kal zêl a, Rama khuaa Naioth a thlen thlengin thu a sawi bual bual zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ani pawhin a silhfênte a hlîp ve a, Samuela hmaah chuan thu a sawi ve ta bual bual a, chumi nilêng leh chumi zankhua chuan ruakin a mu a. Chuvâng chuan, “Saula pawh chu zâwlnei zîngah a tel ve ta elo maw ni?” tih hi an chîng hlen ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu Rama khuaa Naioth ata chu a tlân a, Jonathana hnênah a kal a, “Eng nge maw ka tih le? Eng nge ni ka bawhchhiat? I pa chungah hian eng nge ka tihsuala, hetia mi thah a tum hi ni le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “That suh e a! I thi tawp lo vang! Ngai teh, ka pa chuan mi hriattîr lovin eng mah rêng rêng, lian se tê se a ti ngai lo va. Engah tehlul nge hêng thu hi ka lakah a zêp ang? A zêp tawp lo vang!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “I pa chuan i mi khawngaih dân hi a hre chiang hle mai si a; ‘Jonathana chuan hei chu hre kher suh se; chuti lo zawng, a lungngai dâwn êm mai e,’ a ti a ni ang. Amaherawhchu, Lalpa nunna leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, thihna nêna kan inkâr chu pên khat chauh a ni,” tiin a sawi uar leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “I nunnain a duh apiang chu ka tihsak zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Jonathana hnênah, “Ngai teh, naktûk hi thla thar a ni dâwn a, lal hnêna chawhlui kîl ngei tûr ka ni a; nimahsela, a ni thum ni tlai lam thlengin phûl lamah biru tûrin ka kal zâwk ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, i pain ka awm loh hi lo hre chhuak ta a nih leh, ‘Davida chuan a khua Bethlehem-a va kal lawk min dîl ngawih ngawih a; an chhûngkaw tâna an kum tin inthawi hun a ni e,’ lo ti la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ‘A ṭhat chu,’ a tih chuan i chhiahhlawh chu a thla a muang ang a; amaherawhchu, a thin a rim chuan thil ṭha lo tih a tum a ni tih hre mai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, i chhiahhlawh hi ṭha takin ti ang che, i chhiahhlawh chu Lalpa thuthlungah i luhpui tawh si a. Amaherawhchu, bawhchhiatna nei ka nih chuan nangman min that mai rawh; eng atân nge i pa hnênah mi hruai kher kher ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan, “That suh e a! I chungah thil ṭha lo tih ka pan a tum tih ka hriat phawt chuan ka hrilh dâwn lo che em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Jonathana hnênah, “I pain bung takin lo chhâng ta hlauh ang che sela tuin nge mi hrilh ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Hawh teh, phûlah i va kal teh ang,” a ti a. Tichuan, phûlah chuan an va kal dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu hretu ni rawh se; naktûk hetih hunah emaw, ni thum nîah emaw ka pa ka han dâwp hunah, ngai teh, Davida chungchâng thu a ṭha lam a nih chuan a hnênah mi tîrin ka hrilh dâwn lo che em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ka pain i chungah ṭhil ṭha lo ti duh ta sela, ka hrilh loh chea, thlamuang taka i kal theih nâna ka thlah loh che chuan, Lalpan Jonathana chu a tih tihin ti sela, chu aia nasa pawhin. Tin, Lalpa chu i hnênah awm rawh se, ka pa hnêna a awm ṭhîn angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka thih lohna tûra ka dam chhûng chauhva Lalpa khawngaihna chu mi hmuhtîr ni lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kumkhuain ka chhûngte pawh i khawngaih bâng suh ang che; Lalpan Davida hmêlma lei chung ata a tihbo vek hnu thleng pawhin bâng suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana chuan, “Davida hmêlmate lakah Lalpan a phût ang,” tiin Davida chhûngte hnênah thu a thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan amah a hmangaihna chhâlin Davida hnênah chhia a chham leh a; ama nunna a hmangaih ang chiahin a hmangaih si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana chuan a hnênah, “Naktûk hi thla thar a ni dâwn a; i ṭhuthmun a ruah dâwn avângin i awm loh a lang ngei dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni thum i awm hnu chuan chhuk thuai la, hmâna thil a lo awm laia i bihrûkna hmunah khân lo kal la, Ezel lung bulah chuan awm reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, inthemthiam ni âwm takin thal pathumin a sîrah ka rawn kâp ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, ‘Kal la, thalte kha va zawng hmu rawh,’ tiin naupang ka tîr ang a. Naupang hnêna, ‘En teh, thalte chu i hnung lama kha a awm e, la la, lo kal rawh,’ ka tih chuan Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, i tân a muanawmin hlauh tûr a awm lo a ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, naupang hnêna, ‘En teh, thalte chu i piah lama saw a awm e,’ ka tih chuan kal bo mai ang che; Lalpa chuan a kal botîr che a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, nang leh keiin thil kan sawi tâk chungchang thûah chuan ngai teh, nang nêna kan kârah chuan Lalpa chu a awm kumkhua a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu phûlah chuan a biru a; tin, thla a lo thar chuan lal chu chaw kîlin a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, lal chu ni danga a ṭhutna pângngai bang kianga a ṭhutnaah chuan a ṭhu a. Tin, Jonathana chu a ding a; tin, Abnera chu Saula kiangah a ṭhu a; Davida hmun erawh chu a ruak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, Saula chuan chumi ni chuan eng mah a sawi lo: “A chungah thil eng emaw a awm ang a, a thianghlim lo emaw a ni ang, a thianghlim lo a ni ngei ang,” a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, thla thar tûk a ni hnih ni chuan Davida hmun chu a la ruak ta cheu va; tichuan, Saula chuan a fapa Jonathana hnênah chuan, “Engati nge Jesaia fapa hi niminah leh vawiinah chawhlui kîl tûra a lo kal loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan Saula chu a chhâng a, “Davida chuan Bethlehem-a kal mi dîl ngawih ngawih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Mi kaltîr hrâm rawh khai, kan chhûngte chuan khuaah chuan inthawina an nei dâwn a, ka unau chuan awm ve tûrin mi chah tlat a; chutichuan, mi khawngaih theih chuan mi kaltîr la, ka unaute ka va tlawh ang e,’ a ti a. Chuvâng chuan lal dawhkânah chuan a lo kal lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana chungah chuan Saula thin chu a lo ur ta thut a, a hnênah, “Nang, hmeichhe kawhmawh leh luhlul fapa, Jesaia fapa chu i mualpho nân leh i nu saruakna timualpho tûrin i thlang tih ka hre lo vem ni tehlul?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesaia fapa hi he leia a awm chhûng zawng tihngheh i ni lo vang, i ram pawh. Chuvângin, kohtîr nghâl la, ka hnênah han hruaitîr rawh, a thi ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Jonathanan a pa Saula chu a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Engah nge maw tihhlum tûr a nih ang le? Eng nge a tih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan khawh tumin a fei chu a han lek a; chumi avâng chuan Jonathana chuan a pan Davida chu thah a lo tum ngei a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jonathana chu dawhkân ata chu thinrim takin a tho va, chumi thla ni hnih ni chuan chaw a kîl ve ta lo va; a pa chuan Davida a tihmualpho êm avângin a lungngaihpui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, zîngah chuan Jonathana chu naupang tê hruaiin phûl lamah Davida nêna an hmun ruatah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, a naupang hnênah chuan, “Tlân la, ka thal kahte hi va zawng rawh khai,” a ti a. Tin, naupang chu a tlân lai chuan, a piah lamah chuan thal a kâp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, naupang chuan Jonathana thal kah tlâkna hmun a va thlen chuan Jonathana chuan naupang chu a au va, “Thal chu i piah lama saw a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan naupang chu a au va, “Lo tlân thuai rawh, hmanhmawh rawh, muang suh,” a han ti a. Tin, Jonathana naupang chuan thal chu a chhar khâwm a, a pu hnên lamah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nimahsela, naupang chuan eng mah a hre lo va, Jonathana leh Davida chauh chuan thil awmzia chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan a naupang chu a hriamhrei chu a pe a, a hnênah, “Kal ta la, khuaah lo han hawpui teh ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, naupang chu a kal tâk veleh Davida chu a awm hmun chhim lampang ata chu a lo tho va, hmaia lei siin chibai vawi thum a bûk a; tin, an infâwp a, an ṭap dûn a, Davida chu a zualkai bîk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Thlamuang takin kal rawh aw, ‘ Lalpa chu nang nêna kan kârah leh ka thlahte leh i thlahte kârah kumkhuain awm rawh se,’ tia Lalpa hminga chhia kan chham dun tawh kha,” a ti a. Tichuan, a tho va, a kal ta a; tin, Jonathana chu khuaah chuan a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu Nob khuaah puithiam Ahimeleka hnênah chuan a kal a. Tin, Ahimeleka chuan khûr chungin Davida chu a lo hmuak a, a hnênah, “Engtizia nge i va mal ve, tu mah kalpui i neih loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan puithiam Ahimeleka hnênah chuan, “Lalin thil ti tûrin thu mi pe a, ka hnênah, ‘Ka thil tihtîr tum rêng rêng che leh ka thupêk che hi tu mahin hre suh se,’ a ti tlat a; tin, tlangvâlhote lo awmna tûr hmunte chu ka ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, engte nge i kutah awm le? Chhang hlâwm nga min pe la, a nih loh leh i neih ang apiang pawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan Davida chu a chhâng a, “Chhang narân chu ka nei lo va; chhang thianghlim erawh chu ka nei a, tlangvâlte chu hmeichhe laka an inthiarfihlîm phawt chuan,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan puithiam chu a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Tûn ni thum chhûng chu hmeichhe lakah rêng rêng chuan kan inthiarfihlîm vek tak zet a ni; ka lo chhuah dâwn lai pawh khân tlangvâlte bungbêl chu a thianghlim a ni, khawiilova kal narân mai tûr kan ni nain; vawiin lek phei chuan an bungbêl chu a va thianghlim lehzual dâwn em!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam chuan chhang thianghlim chu a pe ta a; chutah chuan chhangdah an lâk nia chhang luma thlâk tûra Lalpa hma ata an lâka chauh lo chu chhang dang a awm si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan Saula chhiahhlawh zînga mi pakhat Lalpa hmaa hrên a awm a; a hming chu Doega a ni a, Edom mi, Saula ran vêngtu zînga hotu ber a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Ahimeleka hnênah chuan, “Fei emaw, khandaih emaw i kawl lo maw? Lal hnaah chuan hmanhmawh a ṭul avângin ka khandaih leh ka hriamhrei a enga mah ka rawn keng hman lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan, “Philistia mi Goliatha, Ela ruama i thaha khandaih chu ngai teh, puithiam kawr phênah hian puana tuamin a awm reng mai. Chumi chu i lâk duh chuan la rawh; chu chauh lo chu a dang a awm lo,” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Chu lo liam; min pe rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu a tho va, chumi ni chuan Saula hlauvin a tlân bo va, Gath lal Akisa hnênah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Akisa chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “He mi hi an ram lal Davida a ni lâwm ni kha? ‘Saulan a sânga sâng a that, Davidan a sînga sîng,’ tia lâm chungin a chungchâng thu hlain an sa dur dur a ni lâwm ni kha?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan chûng thûte chu a rilruah a pai ta a, Gath lal Akisa chu a hlau ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, a hmaah chuan a awm dân a tidanglam a, an mit hmuhah chuan a â der ta chiam mai a, kawngkhârte chu a ham vak vak a, a khabe hmulahte chuan a chil a tiluang duah duah ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Akisa chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah chuan, “En teh u, mi â a nih in hre reng si a, engati nge ka hnênah in rawn hruai ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi â ka tlâkchham vângin em ni he mi hi a âtzia tilang tûra ka hmaa in rawn hruai ni? He mi hi ka inah a lo lût tehlul ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu chuta ta chu a chhuak a, Adullam pûkah a tlân ta a; tin, a unaute leh a pate chhûngkua zawng zawngin an lo hriat chuan chutah chuan a hnênah an zuk kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, mangang apiang te, leibat nei apiang te, lungnih lohna nei apiangte a hnênah chuan an kal khâwm a; tichuan, an hotuah a awm ta a; tin, a hnênah chuan mi zali emaw lai an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu chuta ta chu Moab rama Mizpe-ah a kal a; Moab lal hnênah chuan, “Pathianin thil min tihsak tûr ka hriat hma loh chu ka nu leh ka pate i hnênah lo awm rawh se aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Moab lal hmaah chuan a hruai a; tichuan, Davida chu kulhbîngah a awm chhûng zawng chuan a hnênah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Gada chuan Davida hnênah, “Kulhbîngah chuan awm reng suh; chhuak la, Judai ramah kal rawh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Davida chu a chhuak a, Hereth ngawah chuan a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida leh a hnêna awmte chu an hmu ta tih a lo hria a. Saula chu Gibea-ah Rama khuaah tamarisk thing hnuaiah a fei kengin a ṭhu a; tin, a vêlah chuan a chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte chu an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan a kiang vêla ding a chhiahhlawhte hnênah chuan, “Nangni Benjamin mite u, ngaithla rawh u; Jesaia fapa chuan lote leh grêp huante a pe ṭheuh dâwn che uin, a sipai sâng hotuah te, a sipai za hotuahte a siam vek dâwn che u em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In zain mi phiara, ka fapain Jesaia fapa hnêna thu a thlun ka hnêna tilang rêng rêng in awm lohva, ka fapain ka chhiahhlawh hi mi do tûr leh vawiin ni te pawha mi châng tûra a fuih thu ka hnêna tilang in awm loh ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chhiahhlawhte kianga ding Edom mi Doega chuan a chhâng a, “Jesaia fapa chu Nob khuaah, Ahituba fapa Ahimeleka hnêna lo kal ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Lalpa a râwnsak a, ei tûr a pe a; tin, Philistia mi Goliatha khandaih a pe bawk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan Ahituba fapa puithiam Ahimeleka leh a pa chhûngkua, Nob khuaa puithiam awm zawng zawngte chu a kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “Nang, Ahituba fapa, lo ngaithla rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ka pu, heta hi ka awm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Saulan a hnênah, “Chhang leh khandaihte lo pea Lalpa te râwnsakin, vawiin nia a tih anga mi do tûr leh mi châng tûra engati nge nangmah leh Jesaia fapa hian mi phiar vêl ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ahimeleka chuan lal chu a chhâng a, “Lal mâkpa, i mi râwn ber ṭhin, in chhûngkuaa mi zahawm Davida ang rêng rênga mi rinawm hi i chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte zîngah tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vawiin hi Pathian ka biakrâwnsak ṭan ni em ni? A ni lo. Lal chuan a chhiahhlawh emaw, ka pa chhûngkuate rêng rêng emaw min puh lul suh se; i chhiahhlawh hian hêng thu zawng zawng hi a enga mah ka hre lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Ahimelek, i thi ngei ngei tûr a ni, nang leh i pa chhûngkua zawng zawngte nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a kianga ding sipaite hnênah chuan, “Lehhawi ula, Lalpa puithiamho hi that rawh u, Davida lamah an ṭang a, a tlân bo tih hre reng sia ka hnêna an sawi loh avângin,” a ti a. Nimahsela, lal chhiahhlawhte chuan Lalpa puithiamte bei tûrin kut an lek duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Doega hnênah chuan, “Nang lehhawi la, puithiamte hi bei rawh,” a ti a. Tin, Edom mi Doega chu a lehhawi a, puithiamte chu a bei a, chumi ni chuan puanzaisîn sin puithiam kawr ha, mi sawmriat leh panga a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Nob, puithiam khua chu khandaihin a bei a; a hmei a pain naupang leh hnute hne laite lamin, bâwng te, sabengtung te, berâmte nên khandaihin a sât hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Ahituba fapa Ahimeleka fapate zînga pakhat, a hming Abiathara chu a tlân chhuak a, Davida hnênah a tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Abiathara chuan Saulan Lalpa puithiamte a thah thu chu Davida a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Abiathara hnênah chuan, “Edom mi Doega chuta a awm ni ngei khân Saula a hrilh ngei ngei ang tih ka hre sa reng a ni; i pa chhûngkua zawng zawngte chu keimah avânga thi an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang chu ka hnênah awm la, hlau suh; kei mi thah tum chuan nang pawh thah an tum ang che; ka hnêna i awm erawh chuan i him ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, “Ngai teh, Philistia mite chuan Keila khua an bei a, hruiha buhte chu an lâksak vek mai,” tih Davida chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan Lalpa chu, “Chûng Philistia mite chu ka zuk bei ang em?” tiin a râwn a. Tin, Lalpa chuan Davida hnênah, “Philistia mite chu zuk bei la, Keila khua chu zuk humhim rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida mite chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Judai rama awm chung pawh hian kan hlau a ni a, Keila khuaa zuk kala Philistia sipaite zuk beih chu a va hlauhawm lehzual âwm ve!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Lalpa chu a râwn leh a. Tin, Lalpa chuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Tho la, Keila khuaah chhuk rawh, Philistia mite chu i kutah ka pe ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh a mite chu Keila khuaah an kal a, Philistia mite chu an zuk bei a, an rante chu an lâksak a, an that chiam a. Chutiang chuan Davidan Keila khuaa mite chu a humhim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Ahimeleka fapa Abiathara Keila khuaa Davida hnêna a tlân lai khân puithiam kawr kenga chhuk thla a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Keila khuaah Davida chu a kal tih Saula an hrilh a. Saula chuan, “Pathianin ka kutah a pe ta a nih chu; kulh kawngka leh a kalhna nei khuaah chuan lûtin a inkhung ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan mi zawng zawng chu indo tûrin, Keila khua zuk beia Davida leh a mite zuk hual tûrin a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Saulan a chungah thil ṭha lo a suangtuah tih chu a lo hria a, puithiam Abiathara hnênah chuan, “Puithiam kawr kha han la teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan, “Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, Saula chuan keimah avângin khua chu tichhe tûrin Keila khuaah chuan lo chhuk a tum tih i chhiahhlawh hian ka hre tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keila khuaa mite hian a kutah min pe ang em? I chhiahhlawhin ka lo hriat ang chuan Saula chu a lo chhuk dâwn em? Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, khawngaih takin i chhiahhlawh hi mi hrilh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “A lo chhuk dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan, “Keila khuaa mite chuan kei leh ka mite hi Saula kutah min pe ang em?” a ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “An pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh a mite, zaruk emaw lai chu an tho va, Keila khua ata chu an chhuak a, kalna remchâng lai apiangah chuan an kal ta a. Tin, Davida chu Keila khua ata a tlân chhuak ta tih Saula an hrilh a; tichuan, thawh chhuah a ṭhulh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu thlalêrah, kulhbîngahte a awm a, Ziph thlalêra tlâng ramah a awm ta reng a. Tin, Saula chuan amah chu ni tin a zawng a; nimahsela, Pathianin a kutah a pe lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan amah tihhlum tumin Saula chu a lo thawk tih a hria a; tichuan, Davida chu Ziph thlalêr ramhnuaiah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Saula fapa Jonathana chu a tho va, ramhnuaiah Davida hnênah chuan a kal a, Pathianah a kut a tihchaksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Hlau hauh suh, ka pa Saula kut chuan a zawng chhuak lo vang che. Israel-te lalah i awm ang a, kei i dawttu ka ni ang; chu pawh chu ka pa Saula hian a hre reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, an pahnih chuan Lalpa hmaah thu an thlung a; tin, Davida chu ramhnuaiah a awm reng a, Jonathana chu a in lamah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ziph mite chu Gibea-ah Saula hnênah an han chho va, “Davida chu kan hnênah ramhnuai kulhbîngah, thlalêr chhim lampang Hakila tlângah a biru reng a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw lalpa, i nunnain lo chhuk a duhthusâm ang ngei chuan lo chhuk tawh la; tin, keini lo tih ve tûr chu lal kuta amah lo hlan chu a ni ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan, “ Lalpa chuan malsâwm che u rawh se; nangniho chuan mi khawngaih hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kal ula, va chian lehzual ula, hnuhma va chhui ula, chutah a hmutu pawh va chian fel leh tê tê rawh u; fing vervêk takin thil a ti ṭhîn tih miin min hrilh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvângin, a bihrûkna hmun zawng zawngte hre diam vek ula; tin, ka hnênah lo kal leh ngei ngei ula; tichuan, in hnênah ka kal ve dâwn nia. Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, he rama a awm phawt chuan Juda mi sâng tam tak zîng ata chu ka zawng chhuak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, an tho va, Saula kal hmain Ziph-ah chuan an kal ta a. Nimahsela, Davida leh a mite chu thlalêr chhim lam Araba-ah Maon thlalêrah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saula leh a mite chuan an zawng ṭan ta a; chu thu chu Davida an hrilh chuan Maon thlalêr lungpui pan chuan a chhuak a, chutah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saula chu tlâng lehlam pangah a kal a; Davida leh a mite chu tlâng lehlam pangah chuan Saula hlauvin hmanhmawh takin an kal bawk a. Saula leh a mite chuan Davida leh a mite chu an man teuh tawh hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Saula hnênah chuan, “Hmanhmawh la, lo kal rawh, Philistia mite chuan kan ram an rawn bei a ni,” tiin zualko a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan Davida a ûm chu a kîrsan a, Philistia mite bei tûr chuan a kal ta a; chuvângin, chumi hmun chu Sela-hamalekoth an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu chuta ta chu a chho va. En-gedi kulhbîngahte chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Saula Philistia mite a va ûm lo haw chu, “Ngai teh, Davida chu En-gedi thlalêrah a awm e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan Israel mi zawng zawngte zîng ata thlan ṭhiau mi sângthum a hruai a, sathârte chênna lungpui zîng lamah chuan Davida leh a mite zawngin an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawng lakah chuan berâm huang, pûk awmna hi a va thleng a; tin, Saula chu inthiarfihlîm tûrin a va lût a. Davida leh a mite chu pûk chhûngril lamahte chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida mite chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Lalpan i hnênah, ‘Ngai teh, i hmêlma chu i kutah ka pe ang a, a chungah ṭha i tih ang angin ti ang che,’ a tih ni kha a nih tâk hi,” an ti a. Chutichuan, Davida chu a tho va, a rûk têin Saula puan fêm chu a va hlep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nakinah chuan Saula puan fêm a va hleh chuan Davida rilru chu a chhun ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A mite hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa hriak thih a ni tih hre reng chung sia, a chunga kut thawha Lalpa hriak thih ka lalpa chunga he thil ka tih hi a âwm lo tawp mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan chûng thu chuan a mite chu a khap bet a, Saula bei tûra an thawh chu a phal ta lo va. Tin, Saula chu pûk ata chu a chhuak a, a kal leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hnu lawkah chuan Davida pawh chu a tho va, pûk ata chu a chhuak a, “Lalpa, ka lalpa,” tiin Saula chu a au zui a. Tin, Saula a han lehhawi chuan Davida chuan a hmaia lei siin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Saula hnênah, “Ngai teh, ‘Davidan i chhiatna a zawng a ni,’ tia miten i hnêna an sawi chu engah nge i âwih ṭhin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai teh, vawiinah hian Lalpan pûkah hian ka kuta a hlanzia che hi i mit ngeiin i hmu a; ṭhenkhat chuan tihlum tûr chein min nawr a; nimahsela, ka zuah chia; ‘Ka Lalpa hriak thih a ni si a,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chauh pawh ni lovin, ka pa, en teh, hei i puan fêm pawh ka ken reng hi! I puan fêm ka hleh theih sia, ka tihhlum loh cheah hian ka kutah hian thil ṭha lo leh bawhchhiatna a awm lo tih leh, ka nunna lâk tumin mi zawng mi zawng mah la, i chungah ka sual lo tih hre ngei ngei rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpan nang nêna kan chung thu hi rêl sela; tin, Lalpa chuan i lakah phuba mi lâksak rawh se; mahse, kei chuan i chungah kut ka thlâk lo rêng rêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmânlai thufingin, ‘Mi sual aṭangin sual a lo chhuak ṭhîn a,’ a ti a; nimahsela, i chungah kut ka thlâk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel lal chu tu zawngin nge a lo chhuah? Tu nge i ûm? Ui thisâwn, uihli lek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chu rorêltu ni sela, nang nêna kan chung thu hi titlu sela, mi ngaihtuahsakin mi sawipui sela, i kut ata mi chhan chhuak rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Davidan Saula hnênah hêng thu hi a sawi zawh chuan Saula chuan, “I aw elo ni, ka fapa Davida?” a ti a. Tin, Saula chu aw chhuah meuhvin a ṭap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Davida hnênah chuan, “Kei ai chuan i fel zâwk êm êm a ni; nang zawngin ka chungah thil ṭha i ti a, kei erawh chuan thil ṭha lo ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, vawiinah hian ka chungah thil ṭha i tihzia i tilang a ni; Lalpan i kuta mi pêk pawha mi tihhlum lohvah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Miin a hmêlma hmu ang sela, him takin a chhuah duh ang em? Chuvângin, vawiina ka chunga i thiltihah hian Lalpan thil ṭhain rûl che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, lal i la ni ngei dâwn a ni tih ka hre ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka hnua ka thlah lo awm tûrte chu tiboral lo tûr leh, ka pa chhûngkaw zîng ata ka hming tibo lo tûrin Lalpa hmingin ka hnênah chhia chham rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Saula hnênah chhia a chham ta a. Tin, Saula chu a haw ta a; Davida leh a mite erawh chu kulhbîngah chuan an chho va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chu a thi ta a; tin, Israel mi zawng zawngte chu an inko khâwm a, an ṭah a. Rama khuaa a inah chuan an phûm ta a. Tin, Davida chu a tho va, Paran thlalêrah a chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maon khuaah chuan mi pakhat a awm a, a khawsakna chu Karmel tlângah a ni; mi ropui tak a ni a, berâm sângthum leh kêl sâng a nei a; Karmel tlângah chuan a berâm hmul a mêt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi hming chu Nabala a ni a, a nupuia hming chu Abigaili a ni. Chu hmeichhia chu bengvâr tak, hmêl ṭha tak a ni a; a mipa erawh chu mi tawhkhirh tak leh sual tak a ni a, Kaleba thlah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Davidan thlalêr aṭang chuan Nabalan a berâm hmul a mêt tih a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan tlangvâl sâwm a tîr a, tlangvâlte hnênah chuan Davidan, “Karmel tlângah han chho ula, Nabala hnênah han kal ula, ka hmingin chibai han bûk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, mi neinung taka hnênah chuan heti hian han sawi ang che u, ‘I chungah te, i chhûngkuate chungah te, i neih zawng zawng chungah te thlamuanna awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I berâm hmul i mêt tih ka lo hria a. I berâm vêngtute chu kan hnênah an awm ṭhîn a, an pawi eng mah kan khawih lo va, Karmel tlânga an awm chhûng rêng rêngin an eng mah an chân lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I tlangvâlte zâwt la, an hrilh mai ang che. Chutichuan, tlangvâlte hi lo khawngaih ang che, a remchân ni takin kan lo thleng a nih hi. I neih ang ang chu i chhiahhlawhte leh i fapa Davida hi lo pe teh ang che, a ti e,’ va ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Davida tlangvâlte chu an va thlen chuan, Davida hmingin chûng thu zawng zawng chu Nabala hnênah chuan an sawi a, an ngawihsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Nabala chuan Davida chhiahhlawhte chu a chhâng a, “Davida chu tu nge maw ni le? Jesaia fapa chu tu nge maw ni le? Tûnlai hian chhiahhlawh, pute tlân bosan hmang an tam mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka chhang te, ka tui te leh ka berâm hmul mêttute tâna sa ka talh te chu tute nge an nih pawh hriat hleih lohte ka pe tehlul ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida tlangvâlte chu an lêt a, an kîr leh a; chûng thu zawng zawng chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a mite hnênah chuan, “In khandaih pai ṭheuh rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, an khandaih an pai ṭheuh va, Davida pawhin a khandaih a pai a. Mi zali laiin Davida chu an zui chho va; tin, mi zahnih chu bungraw vêngin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, tlangvâl pakhat chuan Nabala nupui Abigaili hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, Davida chuan thlalêr aṭangin kan pu chibai bûk tûrin mi a rawn tîr a, ani chuan a lo hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, chung mite chu kan chungah an ṭha hle mai a, kan pawi eng mah an khawih lo va, phûla kan awm laia kan awm ho chhûng zawng zawng khân eng mah kan hloh lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />berâm vênga an hnêna kan awm chhûng zawng zawngin chhûn leh zân kan tân kulh an ni ngawt mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, eng nge i tih dâwn ngun takin ngaihtuah teh khai; kan pu chungah leh a chhûngkua zawng zawngte chungah hian thil ṭha lo tih tum an awm a ni. Ani lah hi a Beliala fapa khawp a, tu ma biak theih loh a ni si a,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Abigaili chuan hmanhmawh takin chhang hlâwm zahnih nên, berâm panga chhum tûra peih diam nên, vai bûk nga nên, grêp rah pho ro bâwr za nên, theipui hlâwm zahnih nên a la khâwm a, sabengtung a phurhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawh tlangvâlte hnênah chuan, “Ka hmaah lo kal ta zêl ula, ngai teh u, ka rawn zui ang che u,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a pasal Nabala chu a hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, chutiang chu a ni a, a sabengtung chungah chuan a chuang a, leisekawtah a chhuk laiin, ngai teh, Davida leh a mite chuan an rawn pan a; tichuan, an intâwk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Davida chuan, “A eng mah a hloh loh nân thlalêrah he pa neih zawng zawngte hi a thlâwn mai maiin ka vênsak a lo nih ngei hi le; thil ṭha chu thil ṭha lovin mi thungrûl ta mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Naktûk zîng khaw ên thlenga a ta zawng zawng zînga mipa naupang pakhat chauh pawh ka zuah vaih chuan, Pathianin Davida hmêlmate chu a tih tihin ti rawh se, chu aia nasa pawhin ti rawh se,” a ti tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Abigaili chuan Davida a hmuh chuan a sabengtung ata chu a chhuk thuai a, Davida hmaah chuan a hmaia lei siin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a ke bulah chuan a bawkkhup a, “Keiman, ka pu, keimah ngeiin khawlohna chu ka hlawh mai ang e. Tin, i chhiahhlawhnu hian i beng hriatah thu sawi sela, i chhiahhlawhnu thusawi chu khawngaih takin ngaihthlâksak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka pu, Beliala mi Nabala chu engah mah ngai suh khai. A hming ang chiah chiah hi a ni a, Nabala tih takah a â a nih hi. Kei i chhiahhlawhnu hi zawngin ka pu tlangvâl rawn tirhte chu ka lo hmu lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah hian ka pu, Lalpa nunna leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, Lalpan thisen chhuah lo tûr leh i kuta phuba la lo tûrin a siam si chia, i hmêlmate leh ka pu ṭhat lohna zawngtute chu Nabala ang ni mai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, hei ka pu tâna i chhiahhlawhin lâwmman ka rawn ken hi ka pu rawn zuitu tlangvâlte hi pêk ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhnu sualna hi khawngaih takin ngaidam ang che. Lalpa chuan ka pu chu chhûngkaw nghet tak a dinsak ngei ngei ang a, ka pu chuan Lalpa indonaahte a dopui si a; i dam chhûng zawngin nangmahah chuan sualna rêng rêng hmuh tûr a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangmah ûm tûr leh i nunna tibo tûrin mite lo thawk mah sela, ka pu nunna chu Lalpa i Pathian nêna nunna têl zinga têl a ni ang a; i hmêlmate nunna erawh chu virvawm phana vawm ang daihin a vawm bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpan i chungchâng thûa a thil ṭha tiam ang zawng zawng ka pu chungah a tih huna Israel-te lala a siam hun che chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a chhan awm lova thisen i chhuah lohva, ka pu chuan phuba i lâk hek loh hi i tân lungngaihna rêng rêng a ni lo vang a, ka pu tân lungnih lohna rêng rêng a ni hek lo vang. Tin, Lalpan ka pu chunga thil ṭha a tih hunah chuan i chhiahhlawhnu hi hre reng ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Abigaili hnênah chuan, “Vawiina mi lo hmuak tûra tîrtu che Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, i remhriatna chu malsâwmin awm sela; tin, nang, thisen chhuah thiam loh channa laka mi humtu leh, keima kuta phuba la lova mi siamtu chu malsâwmin awm bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nang chuan mi lo hmuak thuai suh la chuan, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, naktûk khaw ên thleng chuan Nabala chu naupang pakhat chauh pawh ka zuahsak lo tawp ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan a thil rawn kensakte chu a la a; tin, a hnênah chuan, “Thlamuang takin i in lamah haw chho ta la; tin, i thu chu ka âwih a, i dîl chu ka pawmsak a che aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Abigaili chu Nabala hnênah a han kal a; tin, ngai teh, a inah chuan lal ruai ṭheh ang maiin ruai a lo ṭheh a. A ruih hle avângin Nabala chu a hlim huam mai a; chuvângin, a tûk khaw ên hma loh chuan eng mah a hrilh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, zîng lama Nabala uain rui chu a lo harh chuan a nupui chuan chûng thu chu a han hrilh a, a rilru a mit ta sulh a, lung ang maiin a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni sâwm hnuah chuan Lalpan Nabala chungah kut a thlâk a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Nabala chu a thi tih a han hriat chuan, “Ka hmingchhiatna tûra Nabala thiltih laka mi sawipuia, a chhiahhlawh thil ṭha lo ti lova mi khaptu Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se. Nabala thil ṭha lo tih chu Lalpan ama chung ngeiah a tlâktîr ta a ni,” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan Abigaili chu a nupui atâna va be tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Davida chhiahhlawhte chuan Karmel tlânga Abigaili hnên an han thlen chuan, “Davida chuan a nupui atâna hruai tûr chein min tîr a ni,” tiin ani chu an bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, a hmaia lei siin chibai a bûk a, “Ngai teh u, in chhiahhlawhnu hi ka pu chhiahhlawhte ke sil tûra chhiahhlawh ka ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tichuan, Abigaili chu a tho thuai a, sabengtung chungah a chuang a, a hnungzui nula pangate nên chuan Davida mi tirhte chu an zui a, a nupuiah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Davida chuan Jezreel-a mi Ahinoami a lo nei tawh bawk a; tichuan, a nupuiah an awm ta ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saula chuan a fanu Mikali, Davida nupui kha Galim khuaa mi Laisa fapa Paltia a lo neihtîr tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ziph-ho chu Gibea-ah Saula hnênah an kal a, “Davida chu thlalêr dep Hakila tlângah chuan a biru a ni lâwm ni?” tiin an va sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chu a tho va, Ziph thlalêrah chuan Israel mite zîng ata thlan ṭhiau mi sângthum hruaiin Ziph thlalêrah Davida zawng tûrin a zuk kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan thlalêr dep, kawng lakah Hakila tlângah chuan ṭanhmun a khuar a. Davida erawh chu thlalêrah chuan a awm reng a; tin, Saula chu amah zawngin thlalêrah a lo kal tih a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, Davida chuan enthlatute a tîr a, Saula chu a lo kal tak tak a ni tih a hre chiang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu a tho va, Saula ṭanhmun khuarnaah chuan a kal a. Tin, Davida chuan Saula leh a sipai hotu, Nera fapa Abnera mutna chu a hmu a. Saula chu tawlailîr hual chhûngah a mu a, a vêlin mite chuan awm hmun an rem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Hit mi Ahimeleka leh Joaba unau, Zeruii fapa Abisaia hnênah, “Saula ṭanhmunah chuan tu nge ka hnênah kal ve ang?” tiin a sawi a. Tin, Abisaia chuan, “Keimah i hnênah chuan ka zuk kal ve ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida leh Abisaia chu mipuiho awmnaah zânah chuan an kal a; tin, ngai teh, Saula chu tawlailîr hual chhûngah chuan a lo mu a, a lû lamah chuan a fei chu leiah a vit bûr a. Tin, Abnera leh mite chu a vêlah chuan an lo mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abisaia chuan Davida hnênah, “Vawiinah hian Pathianin i hmêlma chu i kutah a pe che a nih hi; chuvângin, fei hian vawi khatah leiah hian ka han chhun bet tlat mai teh ang aw? Ka chhun nawn leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Davida chuan Abisaia hnênah, “Tiboral suh; Lalpa hriak thih chunga kut thlâka thiam chang thei tu nge awm thei ngai?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Davida vêk chuan, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, Lalpa chuan a chungah kut a thlâk ang chu; a nih loh vêk leh a thih ni a lo la thleng mai ang a; a nih loh vêk leh indonaah a kal ang a, a boral mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa hriak thiha chungah chuan kut ka thlâk loh tûrzia mai chu. A lû bula fei leh tuithâwl erawh hi chu la ila; tichuan, i kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Saula lû bula fei leh tuithâwl chu a la a, an kal leh ta a; tu mân an hmu lo va, tu mân an hriain harh an awm hek lo. Lalpan tui taka a muthilhtîr avângin an muhîl vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu râl lehlamah chuan a kal a, hla feah tlâng chhîpah a ding a; an inkâr chu hla tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan mipuite leh Nera fapa Abnera chu, “Abner, mi han chhâng dâwn lâwm ni?” tiin a au va. Chutichuan, Abnera chuan a chhâng a, “Lal han au veitu chu tu nge maw i nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Abnera hnênah, “Mi huaisen i ni lâwm ni? Israel-te zîngah hian nang ang tu nge awm? Engtizia nge lal i pu i vên loh ni? Lal i pu chu tiboral tûrin tu emaw a lo kal kha le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I thiltih dân hi a ṭha lo a ni. Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, Lalpa hriak thih i pu chu i vên ṭhat loh avângin thi mai tlâk i ni e. Lal lû bula fei leh tuithâwl kha khawiah nge a awm tâk han en teh rêng,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Davida aw chu a han hria a, “Chu i aw elo ni, ka fapa Davida?” a han ti a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Aw lalpa, ka pu, ka aw a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, “Eng vângin nge ka pu hian a chhiahhlawh hi a ûm ni? Eng thil nge ka tih? Ka kutah thil sual eng nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, lalpa, ka pu chuan a chhiahhlawh thu hi ngaithla teh se: mi do tûra i thinlung chawk thotu chu Lalpa a nih chuan thilhlan chu lo pawm sela; mihring fate an nih erawh chuan Lalpa hmaa ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se, ‘Kal la, pathian dangte rawng bâwl rawh,’ tia, Lalpa ro ka luah theih lohna tûra vawiin hian min hnawt bo an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thisen chu Lalpa hmuh phâk lohvah leilungah luang suh se. Varung veh tûra tlângahte mi a ramvâk angin Israel lal chu uihli lek zawng tûrin a kal chhuak a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan, “Thil ka lo tisual dêr mai a ni. Ka fapa Davida, lo haw leh rawh. I mit hmuhah ka nunna hi vawiinah hian a hlut êm avângin eng mah rêng rêng ka tih tawh hauh lo vang che. Ngai teh, thil âtthlâk tak ka lo ti ta a, ka lo tisual dêr mai a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a chhâng a, “Aw lalpa, fei hi han en teh, tlangvâl pakhat lo kal sela, han la rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan mi tin an fel leh an rinawm man a pe dâwn a; vawiinah hian Lalpan nang hi ka kutah min pe na a, Lalpa hriak thih chungah ka kut ka lek duh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, vawiina i nunna ka ngaihhlutsak che ang bawk hian Lalpa chuan ka nunna hi mi ngaihhlutsak sela, manganna zawng zawng ata hi mi chhan chhuak rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan Davida hnênah, “Ka fapa Davida, malsâwmin awm rawh khai. Thiltithei takin i awm ang a, i ngam zêl ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Davida chu a hâwng a; tin, Saula chu a hmun lamah chuan a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a rilruin, “Eng tikah emaw chuan Saula kutah hian ka la boral ngei mai dâwn zawng a nih hi. Philistia mite rama tlân bo aia ṭha hi a awm dâwn lo a nih hi; tichuan, Saula chuan Israel ram chhûng zawng zawngah a mi zawn hi a bei a dawng tawh ang a; tichuan, a kut ata ka chhuak a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu a tho va, amah leh a hnêna mi zaruk awmte chu Maoka fapa, Gath lal Akisa hnênah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu amah nên, a mite nên, mi tin an chhûngkuain, Davida pawh a nupui pahnih, Jezreel mi Ahinoami leh Nabala nupui, Karmel-a mi Abigaili-te nên Gath khuaah Akisa hnênah an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu Gath khuaah a tlân tih Saula an hrilh a; tichuan, a zawng leh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Akisa hnênah, “Min khawngaih la, i rama khaw pakhatah hian awm hmun min pe ve la, chutah chuan ka awm ang e. I chhiahhlawh hi engah nge lal khuaah i hnênah a awm reng ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Akisa chuan chumi ni chuan Ziglag khua chu a pe ta a; chuvângin, Ziglag chu tûn thlengin Judai ram lalte ta a ni ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Philistia rama Davida a awm chhûng chu kum khat pumhlûm leh thla li a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh a mite chu an han chho va, Gesur mi te, Girzi mi te, Amalek mi te an rûn a. Chûng hnamte chu Telam aṭanga Zur ram lampang, Aigupta ram thlenga awm an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan ram chu a bei a, a hmei a pain zuah rêng rêng a nei lo va, berâm te, sebâwng te, sabengtung te, sanghâwngsei te, an silhfên te a lâksak a; tin, a haw leh a, Akisa hnênah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Akisa chuan, “Vawiinah hian khawi lam nge i rûn?” a ti a. Tin, Davida chuan, “Juda Chhim ram te, Jerameel-ho Chhim ram te, Ken-ho Chhim ram te,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, “ ‘Philistia rama a awm chhûng rêng rêngin Davida chuan hetiang hian a ti fo ṭhîn a ni,’ an ti dah ang e,” tiin, Davida chuan a hmei a pain Gath khuaa hruai tûr zuah rêng rêng a nei ngai lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Akisa chuan Davida thusawi chu awihin, “Ama mi Israel-te chu a inhuattîr ta hle mai a; chuvângin, kumkhuain ka chhiahhlawhah a awm ang,” a tih phah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng lai chuan Philistia mite chuan an sipaite chu Israel mite beia do tûrin an khâwm chiam mai a. Tin, Akisa chuan Davida hnênah, “Nang leh i mite chu sipaiho zîngah ka hnênah in kal ngei dâwn a ni tih hre rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Akisa hnênah, “Aw le, i chhiahhlawh thiltihtheih dân chu i hre mai ang,” a ti a. Tin, Akisa chuan Davida hnênah, “A ṭhat chu! Mi vêngtuah ka siam kumkhua ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuela chu a thi tawh a, Israel mi zawng zawng chuan an ṭah a, ama khua ngei Rama khuaah chuan an phûm tawh a. Tin, Saula chuan ramhuai aienthiam zâwlte leh dawithiamte chu a ram ata a hnawt chhuak vek tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chu an pung khâwm a, Sunem-ah chuan ṭanhmun an va khuar a; tin, Saula chuan Israel mi zawng zawng a khâwm a, Gilboa-ah ṭanhmun an khuar ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Saulan Philistia sipaihote a hmuh chuan a hlau va, a rilru a khûr zawih zawih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Lalpa a han râwn pawhin Lalpa chuan mang emaw, Urim emaw, zâwlnei emawin a chhâng lo rêng rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah chuan, “Ramhuai aienthiam zâwl hmeichhia, a hnêna ka kala ka râwn tûrin mi zawnsak rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, a chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Endor khuaah ramhuai aienthiam zâwl hmeichhia a awm asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Saula chu a inbâwl danglam a, puan danglam a inbel a, amah leh mi dang pahnih nên an kal a, zânah hmeichhe hnên chu an va thleng a; tin, “Ramhuai aienna chuan ai mi ensak la, i hnêna a hming ka lam apiang chu mi koh chhuahsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Saula thiltih chu i hria a, a rama ramhuai aienthiam leh dawithiamte chu a tibo zo tawh a, engati nge ka thihna tûrin ka nunna thang i kam dâwn ni le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Saula chuan Lalpa hming chhâlin, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, hemi thil avâng hian i chungah hremna a thleng lo vang,” tiin a hnênah chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhia chuan, “Tu nge ka han koh chhuahsak ang che?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Samuela mi han koh chhuahsak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan Samuela a han hmuh chuan a au vak a; tin, hmeichhia chuan Saula hnênah, “Engati nge mi bum? Saula i ni reng si a?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Hlau suh. Eng nge ni i hmuh tâk le?” a ti a. Tin, hmeichhia chuan Saula hnênah, “Lei aṭanga pathian lo chhuak ka hmu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Eng ang nge a nih?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Putar pui hi a lo chhuak a, kawrfual a ha,” a ti a. Tin, Saula chuan Samuela a ni tih a hria a, a hmaia lei siin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan Saula hnênah, “Engati nge hetianga mi koh chhuah buai ni?” a ti a. Tin, Saula chuan a chhâng a, “Ka mang a ang êm êm atin ni; Philistia mite chuan min do va, Pathian lah chuan mi hawisan a, zâwlnei emaw, mumang emaw pawhin mi chhâng ta lo rêng rêng a. Chuvâng chuan, ka tih tûr mi hrilh tûrin ka ko ta che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Samuela chuan, “Chutia Lalpan a hawisan chia, i hmêlma a lo ni ta tih hre reng chung si chuan engah nge thu mi zawh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keimah hmanga a sawi ang khân Lalpa chuan i chungah a ti ta a nih chu. Lalpa chuan i kut ata ram chu a chhuhsak che a, i ṭhenawm, Davida chu a pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa thu i âwih loh avâng leh Amalek-ho chunga a thinurna nasa tak i hlen loh avângin, tûnah hian i chungah he thil hi a ti ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu, Lalpa chuan nangmah leh Israel-hote chu Philistia mite kutah a pe ang che u a; tin, naktûkah hian nang leh i fapate chu ka hnênah in lo awm ang. Lalpa chuan Israel sipaihote pawh chu Philistia mite kutah a pe ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samuela thusawi avâng chuan Saula chuan a hlau ta êm êm a, leiah a tlu ta dêr a. Tha leh zung rêng rêng a nei ta lo va, nilêng leh zankhuaa chaw ei lo a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chu Saula hnênah chuan a kal a, a lungngai êm êm tih a hria a, a hnênah, “Ngai teh, i chhiahhlawhnu hian i sawi chu ka âwih a, thih leh thih tiin ka hnêna i thusawite chu ka pawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, nang pawhin i chhiahhlawhnu thu chu âwih ve thung ang che; chaw tlêm tal ka han hlui ang chia; tichuan, i hâwn huna thahrui i neih theih nân ei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, a duh lo va, “Ka ei lo vang,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a chhiahhlawhte chuan hmeichhia nên chuan an tîr lui a; an thu chu a âwih ta a. Chutichuan, lei ata chu a tho va, khumah chuan a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan sebâwngno châwm thau a inah chuan a nei a, a va talh thuai a. Tin, chhangphut a la a, a hmet a, dawidim tel lo chhang a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Saula leh a chhiahhlawhte hmaah chuan a va hlui a; tin, an lo ei ta a. Chutichuan, an tho va, chumi zân chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia mite chuan an sipai zawng zawngte chu Aphek-ah an khâwm vek a; tin, Israel mite chuan Jezreel-a tuikhur kiangah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Philistia-ho lalte chu za têl têl te, sâng têl têl tein an kal zut zut mai a. Tin, Davida leh a mite chuan Akisa nên hnu an dâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia lalte chuan, “Hêng Hebrai-hote hian eng nge an tih?” an ti a. Akisa chuan Philistia lalte hnênah chuan, “He mi hi Davida, Israel-te lal Saula chhiahhlawh, hei leh chen ka hnêna awm tawha, ka hnêna a lo tlûk luh ata tûn thleng pawha a sualna ka hmuh loh va chu a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Philistia lalte chu a chungah an thinrim a; Philistia lalte chuan a hnênah, “Chu mi chu i hmun ruatsakah khân haw tûrin kîrtîr la, indonaah kan hnênah zuk kal ve suh se; chuti lo chuan, indonaah kan hmêlma lamah a ṭang mai dah ang e. Kan mite lû a la ang a, a pu nên an inrem leh hlauh si ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />He Davida hi a ni lâwm ni, lâm chunga - ‘Saulan a sânga sâng a that, Davidan a sînga sîng,’ tia a chungchâng thu hlaa an saka kha?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Akisa chuan Davida chu a ko va, a hnênah, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, mi dik tak i lo ni a, sipaihote zînga ka hnênah i kal leh i haw ṭhinte chu ka mit hmuhah chuan a ṭha hle mai a. Ka hnêna i lo kal ni ata vawiin thlengin i chungah eng mah ṭhat lohna rêng rêng ka hmu hauh lo mai. Nimahsela, lalhote hian an ngaina lo che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Philistia lalhote i tihlungnih loh loh nân kîr leh la, lungawi takin kal ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Akisa hnênah, “A nih leh, eng thil nge maw ka lo tih le? I hnêna ka awm chhûng zawng vawiin thleng hian, ka pu, lalber hmêlma chu do lova ka han kîr leh maina tûrin i chhiahhlawh chungah hian eng nge maw hriat i neih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Akisa chuan a chhâng a, Davida hnênah, “Ka mit hmuhah chuan Pathian vântirhkoh ang maiin i ṭha a; nimahsela, Philistia lalhote hian, ‘Indonaah kan hnênah a han kal ve lo vang,’ an ti tlat mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, i hnêna kal ve i pu chhiahhlawhte nên hian zîng takah tho ula; tin, zîng takah in thawha khua a ên veleh kal ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh a mite chu Philistia rama kîr leh tûra zînga chhuak tûrin zîng takah an tho ta a. Tin, Philistia mite chu Jezreel-ah an chho ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni thum nia Davida leh a miten Ziglag an thlen chuan, Amalek-hovin Chhim lam leh Ziglag khua chu an lo rûn tawh reng a, Ziglag khua chu an lo sawisa a, an lo hâl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hmeichhiate leh chumi khuaa awm apiangte chu a lian a têin salah an man a; tu mah that lovin an hruai a, an hâwnpui tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh a miten khua an va thlen chuan, ngai teh, a lo kâng fai vek tawh a; tin, an nupuite, an fapate, an fanute chu salah an lo man tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh a hnêna awmte chuan an aw an chhuah a, an ṭah hleih theih loh thlengin an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davida nupuite pahnih Jezreel mi Ahinoami leh Karmel-a mi Nabala nupui Abigaili-te pawh salah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a mangang hle mai a; an fapate leh an fanute avânga mi zawng zawng an thin a nat êm êma, amah chu lunga den thu an sawi avângin. Nimahsela, Davida chu a Pathian Lalpa ah chuan a intichak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Ahimeleka fapa puithiam Abiathara hnênah chuan, “Puithiam kawr mi va lâksak teh khai,” a ti a. Tin, Abiathara chuan Davida chu puithiam kawr chu a va lâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Chûngho chu ûm ila ka la ûm pha ang em le?” tiin Lalpa a zâwt a. Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Um rawh, i ûm pha ngei ngei ang a, i chhan chhuak vek ngei ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chu a kal ta a, amah leh a hnêna mi zarukte nên; tin, Besor lui chu an va thleng a, an mi hnutchhiahte chu chutah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida erawh chuan a ûm zêl a, amah leh mi zalite nên chuan, mi zahnih chu an chauh tawh avângin Besor lui chu an kân ve thei ta lo va, an lo awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, phûlah hian Aigupta mi an va hmu a, Davida hnênah an hruai a; chhang an pe a, a lo ei a; tin, tui in tûr an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, theipui hlâwm tlang khat leh grêp rah pho ro bâwr hnih an pe a. Chûng chu a han ei chuan a lo harh leh ta a; ni thum leh zan thum chaw ei lo leh tui in lo a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “Tu mi nge i nih? Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Aigupta ram tlangvâl, Amalek mi chhiahhlawh ka ni a; tin, ni thum a ni ta a, ka damloh avângin ka puin mi kalsan ta mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kereth Chhim ram leh Juda chan Chhim ramte kan rûn a, Kaleb Chhim ram kan rûn bawk a; tin, Ziglag khua kan hâl bawk a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan a hnênah, “Chûnghote awmnaah chuan min zuk hruai thei ang em?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Min that lo tûr leh ka pu kuta mi pe leh lo tûrin Pathian hming chhâlin ka hnênah chhia chham la; tichuan, chûngho awmnaah chuan ka zuk hruai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a zuk hruai thlâk chuan, ngai teh, Philistia ram leh Judai rama râllâk tam tak an lâk avângin ruai an ṭheh a, an eiin an in a, an lo awm darh nuaih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan ni tlâk aṭanga a tûk tlai lam thlengin a bei ta a, tlangvâl zali, sanghâwngsei chunga chuanga tlânchhehote chauh lo chu tu mah dama chhuak rêng rêng an awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Amalek miten an lâk zawng zawng chu a la leh vek a; tin, Davida chuan a nupui pahnihte chu a chhan chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, a lian a têin, an fapate, an fanute, an râllâk leh an thil lâk rêng rêng eng mah chân an nei lo va, Davida chuan a lâksak leh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan berâm rual leh ran rual zawng zawngte chu a la a, ran dangte hmaah an khalh a, “Hêng hi Davida râllâk a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, mi zahnih, an chauh avânga Davida zui thei ta lova Besor luia an awmtîrte hnên chu Davida chuan a va thleng a. Tin, anni chu Davida hmuak tûr leh a hnêna awmte hmuak tûrin an kal chhuak a. Tin, Davidan mipuite kiang a va thlen chuan chibai a bûk hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida hnêna kalhote zînga mi sualte leh Beliala mi zawng zawngte chuan an chhâng a, “Kan hnêna an kal ve loh avângin râllâk thil kan va chhuh leh rêng rêng chu kan pe ve lo vang a, an hruaia, an kal theih nân an nupuite leh an fate ṭheuh erawh chu an hruai kan phal ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan, “Unaute u, Lalpa , min humsaka, min do tûra lo thawkho kan kuta petu thil min pêkte chu chutiang chuan in ti lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin nge he thûah hian in thu pawm ang? Indonaa zuk kalte chan ang bawk chu bungraw vênga lo awmte chuan an chang ve tûr a ni alâwm; inang vekin chan tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi ni aṭanga tûn thleng hian Israel-te tân thupêkah leh dâna luang tûrin a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Ziglag khua a thlen chuan râllâk ṭhenkhat chu, “Hei, Lalpa hmêlmate laka râllâk, lâwmman atân ka thawn a che u,” tiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bethel-a awm te, Chhim Ramoth-a awm te, Jatir-a awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aroer-a awm te, Sipmoth-a awm te, Estemo-a awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rakal-a awm te, Jerameel khuatea awm te, Ken khuatea awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Horma-a awm te, Borasan-a awm te, Athak-a awm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron-a awmte leh Davida leh a mite chêttlatna ṭhin hmun zawng zawnga awm Juda upa, a ṭhiante hnênah chuan a thawn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia mite chuan Israel-hote chu an bei a; tin, Israel mite chu Philistia mite lakah chuan an tlânchhia a, Gilboa tlângah chuan thahin an awm ta zul mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia mite chuan Saula leh a fapate chu an ûm zui ta ngat ngat a. Tin, Philistia mite chuan Saula fapate - Jonathana leh Abinadaba leh Malkisua chu an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saula chu an bei nasa ta êm êm mai a. Thal kâp mite chuan an kâp fuh a, na takin an hliam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a râlthuam kengtu hnênah chuan, “I khandaih phawi la, mi han chhun tlang rawh; chuti lo chuan, hêng serhtan lohhote hi an lo kal ang a, mi rawn chhun tlang ang a, mi uankhum dah ang e,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a râlthuam kengtu chuan a ti duh lo va, a hlau êm êm si a. Chuvângin, Saula chuan a khandaih chu a la a, a bawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a râlthuam kengtu chuan Saula a thi tih a hriat chuan a khandaih chu a bawh ve a, an thi dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula nên, a fapate pathum nên, a râlthuam kengtu nên, a mite zawng zawng nên, chumi ni ngei chuan an thi za ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ruam râl lehlama Israel mi awmte leh Jordan râla awmten, Israel mite an tlânchhia tih leh Saula leh a fapate an thi tih an hriat chuan, khuate chu an chhuahsan a, an tlân bo ta a; tin, Philistia mite chuan an va luah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah chuan Philistia-hoten an râl thahte thuam hlihsak tûra an va kal chuan Saula leh a fapate pathum Gilboa tlânga an lo thi chu an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a lû chu an tan a, a râlthuam chu an hlîp a, chanchin chu an milem biakna inah leh mite hnêna puang tûrin Philistia ramah chuan an thawn vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a râlthuam chu Astorethi inah an dah a; a ruang chu Beth-san kulh bangah an târ a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Jabes-gilead-a awmten Philistia miten Saula an tih dân chungchâng thu chu an lo hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mi huaisen zawng zawngte chu an tho va, zankhuain an kal a, Saula ruang leh a fapate ruang chu Beth-san kulh bang ata chu an la a; tin, Jabes an lo thleng a, chutah chuan an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an ruhte chu an la a, Jabes-a tamarisk thing hnuaiah an phûm a; tin, ni sarih chaw an nghei a.
  </para>
</usx>
